# Built by tools\dlg_small_hooks.py from tools\dlg_small_hooks*.txt: edit those, not this one.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_people
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_people
- Why do you like animals so much?
- Do you get along better with animals than with people?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_people.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_people
- Ask who let her down

@rule react.h.animals_yes_people.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_people move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nobody in particular. People just say one thing and mean another.
- Let's say a dog has never talked behind my back.
- That's a long story. A dog would've let me finish it, though.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_people.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_yes_people
- Say animals are easier company for you too

@rule react.h.animals_yes_people.share
on react
when hook=animals_yes_people move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? You just sit there, and nobody needs anything.
- So you get it. Most people laugh at me for that.
- Then we should sit in the park and not talk. I'd like that.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_people.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_yes_people
- Ask if that makes you the exception

@rule react.h.animals_yes_people.tease
on react
when hook=animals_yes_people move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You're on probation. Don't bite anyone.
- Hmm. A cat would've made up its mind about you by now.
- You're almost as good as a dog. Almost.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_people.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_people fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't laugh at that. I meant it.
- You're proving my point, you know.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_cats
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_cats
- Are you a cat person or a dog person?
- I saw a stray cat by the gate this morning.
- Have you met the courtyard cat?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_cats.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_cats
- Ask which cat is her favorite

@rule react.h.animals_yes_cats.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_cats move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The one that ignores me. I've tried four names on it.
- I call one Boss. It looks at me like I owe it money.
- One has about six names. It only answers to the sound of a can.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_cats.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_yes_cats
- Say cats never come when you call them

@rule react.h.animals_yes_cats.share
on react
when hook=animals_yes_cats move=share fit=good|neutral
- They come when they want to, and that's what makes it feel special.
- You have to sit still and pretend you don't care. Then they're on your lap.
- You're doing it wrong. Look away first, it's a matter of respect.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_cats.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_yes_cats
- Say she's turning into a cat lady

@rule react.h.animals_yes_cats.tease
on react
when hook=animals_yes_cats move=tease fit=good|neutral
- One cat is a hobby. Five is a lifestyle. I'm still deciding.
- Laugh now. When I'm old, I'll be surrounded and you'll be jealous.
- Excuse me, a cat lady has dignity.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_cats.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_cats fit=bad
feel pout
- Say what you want. The cats like me better than you.
- Hmph. You've probably never been sat on by a cat.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_dogs
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_dogs
- Do you like dogs?
- There's a dog at the park that looks just like the dean.
- Big dogs or small dogs?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_dogs.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_dogs
- Ask what kind of dog she'd get

@rule react.h.animals_yes_dogs.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_dogs move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something big and stupid that thinks it's small.
- A shiba, the kind that screams when you take it to the vet.
- One from the shelter. The ugly one nobody picks.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_dogs.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_yes_dogs
- Say a dog always knows when you're down

@rule react.h.animals_yes_dogs.share
on react
when hook=animals_yes_dogs move=share fit=good|neutral
- They really do! They just come over and lean on you.
- That's why I pet every one I see. I'm collecting.
- Yes. No questions, no advice. Just a heavy head on your knee.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_dogs.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_yes_dogs
- Ask if she barks back at them

@rule react.h.animals_yes_dogs.tease
on react
when hook=animals_yes_dogs move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only at the small ones, and only when nobody's around.
- I've been known to hold a whole conversation with a corgi, thank you.
- Hey! Maybe a little.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_dogs.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_dogs fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't insult dogs in front of me.
- Dogs have better manners than that.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_small
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_small
- You like small animals, don't you?
- Have you always liked animals?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_small.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_small
- Ask how she earned that trust

@rule react.h.animals_yes_small.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_small move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Patience, and a lot of crumbs. It took weeks.
- You don't move, and you talk quietly. That's all there is to it.
- Food. It's always food. Love is a bribe.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_small.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_yes_small
- Say you never noticed the small ones

@rule react.h.animals_yes_small.share
on react
when hook=animals_yes_small move=share fit=good|neutral
- Most people don't. That's why I like them.
- Try it. Sit by the pond for ten minutes, you'll see a whole soap opera.
- Then I'll show you. They're the funniest ones.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_small.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_yes_small
- Say she runs a tiny kingdom

@rule react.h.animals_yes_small.tease
on react
when hook=animals_yes_small move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Bow, then. My army's watching.
- Mock me all you want, they'll remember your face.
- It's a small kingdom, but it's mine.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_small.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_small fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't have to make fun of them. They're small.
- It's not that funny.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_zoo
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_zoo
- Have you been to the zoo lately?
- If you could have any animal, what would it be?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_zoo.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_zoo
- Ask what she'd see first

@rule react.h.animals_yes_zoo.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_zoo move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The penguins! They walk like tiny old men.
- The baby animals, before they get crowded.
- The otters, at feeding time. I've memorized the schedule.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_zoo.praise
on move.praise
when hook=animals_yes_zoo
- Say she lights up talking about it

@rule react.h.animals_yes_zoo.praise
on react
when hook=animals_yes_zoo move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Do I? Well, you try being serious about a penguin.
- That's because it's the best place in the city. I'm not exaggerating.
- Oh, stop. I'm only excited a normal amount.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_zoo.invite
on move.invite
when hook=animals_yes_zoo
- Offer to go with her

@rule react.h.animals_yes_zoo.invite
on react
when hook=animals_yes_zoo move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? I'll bring the map. I've got a route.
- You'll have to carry the souvenirs. That's the deal.
- Saturday, then! Don't back out once you've seen the penguins.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_zoo.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_zoo fit=bad
feel pout
- Hm. Maybe I'll just go alone.
- You don't have to come if you think it's silly.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_future
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_future
- Have you thought about working with animals?
- Do you know a lot about animal care?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_future.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_future
- Ask what the hardest part is

@rule react.h.animals_yes_future.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_future move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The ones nobody comes back for. That's all I'll say.
- The paperwork, honestly. And saying goodbye.
- Cleaning, if you want the funny answer. The other answer isn't funny.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_future.praise
on move.praise
when hook=animals_yes_future
- Say she'd be great at it

@rule react.h.animals_yes_future.praise
on react
when hook=animals_yes_future move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You think so? I get so attached, though.
- That's nice to hear. Everyone else tells me it doesn't pay.
- I hope so. I really do want to be good at it.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_future.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=animals_yes_future
- Say it can't be easy

@rule react.h.animals_yes_future.comfort
on react
when hook=animals_yes_future move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It isn't. But when one of them gets a home, I forget all that.
- Thanks. Most people just say it sounds cute.
- Some days are hard. I just go home and hug something.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_future.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_future fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not a joke to me.
- I shouldn't have told you.

@rule me.h.animals_yes_pets
on me.small
when hook=animals_yes_pets
- Did you ever have a pet growing up?
- What's the cutest animal you've ever seen?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_pets.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_yes_pets
- Ask to see her photos

@rule react.h.animals_yes_pets.ask
on react
when hook=animals_yes_pets move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Okay, but you asked for this. There are hundreds.
- This one's blurry, but look at the ears!
- I've got a whole album. That's the normal amount, right?

@rule move.h.animals_yes_pets.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_yes_pets
- Tell her about the pet you wanted as a kid

@rule react.h.animals_yes_pets.share
on react
when hook=animals_yes_pets move=share fit=good|neutral
- Aw. And your parents said no? They always do.
- What would you have named it? You have to tell me.
- You can borrow mine. No, I'm serious.

@rule move.h.animals_yes_pets.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_yes_pets
- Say she has more animal friends than human ones

@rule react.h.animals_yes_pets.tease
on react
when hook=animals_yes_pets move=tease fit=good|neutral
- At least mine don't ask to copy my notes.
- Quality over quantity.
- I'd be offended, but it's true.

@rule react.h.animals_yes_pets.bad
on react
when hook=animals_yes_pets fit=bad
feel pout
- Fine, you don't have to look.
- You're no fun.

@rule me.h.animals_no_allergy
on me.small
when hook=animals_no_allergy
- Are you okay around animals?
- Do you have any pets?

@rule move.h.animals_no_allergy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_no_allergy
- Ask how bad it gets

@rule react.h.animals_no_allergy.ask
on react
when hook=animals_no_allergy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- My eyes swell up, and I sound like a dying kettle.
- Ten minutes in a room with a cat and I'm done.
- Bad enough that I carry tissues to other people's houses.

@rule move.h.animals_no_allergy.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=animals_no_allergy
- Say it must be annoying when everyone gushes

@rule react.h.animals_no_allergy.comfort
on react
when hook=animals_no_allergy move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- A little, yes. They all shove their phones at me.
- Thank you! Nobody ever thinks about that side of it.
- It's fine. Just don't invite me to the cat café.

@rule move.h.animals_no_allergy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_no_allergy
- Say it's the animals who are allergic to her

@rule react.h.animals_no_allergy.tease
on react
when hook=animals_no_allergy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Then we agree to stay apart. Very mature of us.
- Hah. That'd explain the looks they give me.
- Don't give them any ideas.

@rule react.h.animals_no_allergy.bad
on react
when hook=animals_no_allergy fit=bad
feel pout
- It's a real thing, you know.
- Sure, laugh at the sick girl.

@rule me.h.animals_no_trauma
on me.small
when hook=animals_no_trauma
- Did an animal do something to you?
- Do animals usually like you?

@rule move.h.animals_no_trauma.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_no_trauma
- Ask what happened exactly

@rule react.h.animals_no_trauma.ask
on react
when hook=animals_no_trauma move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It looked me in the eye first. That's the part I can't forgive.
- I ran, it ran faster. There were witnesses.
- You really want the details? Fine. It was personal.

@rule move.h.animals_no_trauma.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_no_trauma
- Admit one scared you once too

@rule react.h.animals_no_trauma.share
on react
when hook=animals_no_trauma move=share fit=good|neutral
- See? They know what they're doing.
- Finally, someone sane. They have teeth on their tongues!
- Then you understand me better than anyone here.

@rule move.h.animals_no_trauma.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_no_trauma
- Say the animal probably started it, not you

@rule react.h.animals_no_trauma.tease
on react
when hook=animals_no_trauma move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Whose side are you on?
- It started it! I was only standing there!
- I'd like to see you try it. Good luck.

@rule react.h.animals_no_trauma.bad
on react
when hook=animals_no_trauma fit=bad
feel pout
- You weren't there.
- That's not funny. I still have the scar.

@rule me.h.animals_no_distance
on me.small
when hook=animals_no_distance
- What do you think of pets?
- Would you ever keep an animal?

@rule move.h.animals_no_distance.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_no_distance
- Ask if there's any animal she'd tolerate

@rule react.h.animals_no_distance.ask
on react
when hook=animals_no_distance move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A fish. Behind glass. Ideally someone else's.
- A photo of a cat is acceptable.
- Maybe something that sleeps all day and asks for nothing.

@rule move.h.animals_no_distance.share
on move.share
when hook=animals_no_distance
- Say you get why people go crazy over them, even so

@rule react.h.animals_no_distance.share
on react
when hook=animals_no_distance move=share fit=good|neutral
- I suppose. I just like them better on a screen.
- You can have my share of the affection, then.
- That's fine. I don't bite anyone who likes cats.

@rule move.h.animals_no_distance.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_no_distance
- Say animals can smell that on her

@rule react.h.animals_no_distance.tease
on react
when hook=animals_no_distance move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Then they know to keep walking. Good.
- Hey, the feeling's mutual.
- Then at least they're smart.

@rule react.h.animals_no_distance.bad
on react
when hook=animals_no_distance fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't have to like everything, do I?
- Not liking animals doesn't make me a monster.

@rule me.h.food_yes_ramen
on me.small
when hook=food_yes_ramen
- Any good places to eat around here?
- Do you have a favorite restaurant?

@rule move.h.food_yes_ramen.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_yes_ramen
- Ask what to order there

@rule react.h.food_yes_ramen.ask
on react
when hook=food_yes_ramen move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything, but start with the house special. Extra onions.
- Whatever the old man is proud of today. You'll know by his face.
- The small portion is a trap. Don't fall for it.

@rule move.h.food_yes_ramen.share
on move.share
when hook=food_yes_ramen
- Say you've been eating cafeteria food for weeks

@rule react.h.food_yes_ramen.share
on react
when hook=food_yes_ramen move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's so sad. Who hurt you?
- We have to fix that. Tonight, if possible.
- No wonder you look like that. I mean, hungry.

@rule move.h.food_yes_ramen.invite
on move.invite
when hook=food_yes_ramen
- Ask her to take you there

@rule react.h.food_yes_ramen.invite
on react
when hook=food_yes_ramen move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Finally, someone with sense. Bring cash, they don't take cards.
- Okay, but no talking until the bowl's empty. That's the rule.
- Yes! I've been waiting for someone to ask.

@rule react.h.food_yes_ramen.bad
on react
when hook=food_yes_ramen fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it. I don't share my places with just anybody.
- You don't deserve that broth.

@rule me.h.food_yes_hungry
on me.small
when hook=food_yes_hungry
- What did you have for lunch?
- What would you order right now?
- If I treat you, what do I buy?

@rule move.h.food_yes_hungry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_yes_hungry
- Ask what she's craving right now

@rule react.h.food_yes_hungry.ask
on react
when hook=food_yes_hungry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something fried. Something with a crust. I'm losing focus.
- A bowl of rice the size of my head.
- Don't ask me that. I can feel my stomach listening.

@rule move.h.food_yes_hungry.share
on move.share
when hook=food_yes_hungry
- Offer her half of your snack

@rule react.h.food_yes_hungry.share
on react
when hook=food_yes_hungry move=share fit=good|neutral
- You're a saint. Hand it over, slowly.
- You're serious? No taking it back.
- I could marry you for that. Temporarily.

@rule move.h.food_yes_hungry.tease
on move.tease
when hook=food_yes_hungry
- Ask if she's ever not hungry

@rule react.h.food_yes_hungry.tease
on react
when hook=food_yes_hungry move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Twice. I had a fever both times.
- When I'm asleep. And I dream about food.
- No. This is what I'm like. Accept it.

@rule react.h.food_yes_hungry.bad
on react
when hook=food_yes_hungry fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't joke about food when I'm like this.
- Careful. I bite when I'm hungry.

@rule me.h.food_yes_trip
on me.small
when hook=food_yes_trip
- What's the best thing you've eaten lately?
- Do you like trying local food?

@rule move.h.food_yes_trip.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_yes_trip
- Ask what's first on her list

@rule react.h.food_yes_trip.ask
on react
when hook=food_yes_trip move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Takoyaki in Osaka, from a stall with a line down the block.
- Fresh crab in Hokkaido. I've done the math. I can't afford it.
- Noodles in Kagawa. People take pilgrimages for those.

@rule move.h.food_yes_trip.share
on move.share
when hook=food_yes_trip
- Tell her the best meal you had on a trip

@rule react.h.food_yes_trip.share
on react
when hook=food_yes_trip move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh, that's cruel. Now I need to go there.
- Write that down for me. I'm adding it to the list.
- See, you get it. The food is the whole trip.

@rule move.h.food_yes_trip.invite
on move.invite
when hook=food_yes_trip
- Say you'd carry the bags for a bite of everything

@rule react.h.food_yes_trip.invite
on react
when hook=food_yes_trip move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Deal. You're hired as my second stomach.
- Only if you can keep up. People have tried.
- I'll add you to the itinerary. Don't embarrass me.

@rule react.h.food_yes_trip.bad
on react
when hook=food_yes_trip fit=bad
feel pout
- You can stay home, then.
- Hmph. More for me.

@rule me.h.food_yes_list
on me.small
when hook=food_yes_list
- You know a lot about food, huh?
- Where should I eat around here?

@rule move.h.food_yes_list.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_yes_list
- Ask what's at the top of her list

@rule react.h.food_yes_list.ask
on react
when hook=food_yes_list move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Top secret. All right, it's the crepes behind the arcade.
- It changes every week. That's the fun part.
- I can't choose. I'd have to ask my stomach.

@rule move.h.food_yes_list.praise
on move.praise
when hook=food_yes_list
- Say you'd trust her over any guidebook

@rule react.h.food_yes_list.praise
on react
when hook=food_yes_list move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You should! Guidebooks have never had to skip class for gyoza.
- That's the nicest thing you've said to me.
- I've earned it, one meal at a time.

@rule move.h.food_yes_list.invite
on move.invite
when hook=food_yes_list
- Tell her to pick a place for you

@rule react.h.food_yes_list.invite
on react
when hook=food_yes_list move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Careful what you ask for. I take this very seriously.
- Okay. Come hungry, and bring an open mind.
- I'll choose. You just have to show up and suffer happily.

@rule react.h.food_yes_list.bad
on react
when hook=food_yes_list fit=bad
feel pout
- You just don't get food.
- Then eat your sad bread.

@rule me.h.food_yes_gourmet
on me.small
when hook=food_yes_gourmet
- If you could only eat one thing forever, what would it be?
- What's your comfort food?

@rule move.h.food_yes_gourmet.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_yes_gourmet
- Ask what her last meal would be

@rule react.h.food_yes_gourmet.ask
on react
when hook=food_yes_gourmet move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Rice, grilled fish, and my grandmother's pickles. It's simple.
- Fried chicken. Then, if there's time, more fried chicken.
- What a thing to ask at this time of day. Give me a week.

@rule move.h.food_yes_gourmet.share
on move.share
when hook=food_yes_gourmet
- Say a good meal fixes most things

@rule react.h.food_yes_gourmet.share
on react
when hook=food_yes_gourmet move=share fit=good|neutral
- Yes! You understand! Who raised you?
- That's basically my whole philosophy.
- Most things. The rest need dessert.

@rule move.h.food_yes_gourmet.tease
on move.tease
when hook=food_yes_gourmet
- Say she thinks with her stomach

@rule react.h.food_yes_gourmet.tease
on react
when hook=food_yes_gourmet move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It's been right so far.
- My stomach's smarter than I am. Don't tell it.
- And yet I've never missed a meal. Who's the fool?

@rule react.h.food_yes_gourmet.bad
on react
when hook=food_yes_gourmet fit=bad
feel pout
- Laugh all you want. I'll be eating.
- There's no need to be mean about it.

@rule me.h.food_no_small
on me.small
when hook=food_no_small
- What did you have for lunch?
- Do you eat much?

@rule move.h.food_no_small.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_no_small
- Ask if she's eaten at all today

@rule react.h.food_no_small.ask
on react
when hook=food_no_small move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A rice ball. It counts.
- I had something this morning, I think.
- You sound like my mother. Yes. A little.

@rule move.h.food_no_small.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=food_no_small
- Say you hope she's looking after herself

@rule react.h.food_no_small.comfort
on react
when hook=food_no_small move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I'm fine, really. But thanks. Nobody asks.
- That's kind of you. I'll eat something later.
- I am. I just don't have much of an appetite.

@rule move.h.food_no_small.tease
on move.tease
when hook=food_no_small
- Say a sparrow would call that a light snack

@rule react.h.food_no_small.tease
on react
when hook=food_no_small move=tease fit=good|neutral
- The sparrow should mind its own business.
- I'm efficient. There's a difference.
- You're just jealous of my lunch budget.

@rule react.h.food_no_small.bad
on react
when hook=food_no_small fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't you start on me too.
- Why does everyone care how much I eat?

@rule me.h.food_no_picky
on me.small
when hook=food_no_picky
- Is there anything you can't eat?
- What's a food you could never stand?

@rule move.h.food_no_picky.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_no_picky
- Ask what she can actually eat

@rule react.h.food_no_picky.ask
on react
when hook=food_no_picky move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Plain rice, boiled eggs, and soup that doesn't try too hard.
- Anything I can recognize.
- Short list. It fits on a napkin.

@rule move.h.food_no_picky.share
on move.share
when hook=food_no_picky
- Say you know a place with plain, honest food

@rule react.h.food_no_picky.share
on react
when hook=food_no_picky move=share fit=good|neutral
- Plain? Really plain? I may be interested.
- Nobody's ever recommended me anything like that.
- No fried anything? Then I'll think about it.

@rule move.h.food_no_picky.tease
on move.tease
when hook=food_no_picky
- Say she'd send back a glass of water

@rule react.h.food_no_picky.tease
on react
when hook=food_no_picky move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only if it's too strongly flavored.
- It's called having standards.
- That's a nice joke, for someone who eats anything.

@rule react.h.food_no_picky.bad
on react
when hook=food_no_picky fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not my fault.
- Not everyone wants their food covered in grease.

@rule me.h.food_no_hype
on me.small
when hook=food_no_hype
- What's your take on food trends?
- Do you get why people line up for food?

@rule move.h.food_no_hype.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_no_hype
- Ask what she'd rather spend the time on

@rule react.h.food_no_hype.ask
on react
when hook=food_no_hype move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sleeping. It's free, and no one takes a picture of it.
- Literally anything. A nap. A walk. A wall.
- There's a whole world that isn't a restaurant queue.

@rule move.h.food_no_hype.agree
on move.agree
when hook=food_no_hype
- Agree that it's only food

@rule react.h.food_no_hype.agree
on react
when hook=food_no_hype move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. It's a sandwich. It'll still be a sandwich tomorrow.
- Finally. I was starting to think I was the strange one.
- Right? And then they spend ten minutes taking pictures of it.

@rule move.h.food_no_hype.tease
on move.tease
when hook=food_no_hype
- Say she's just never had the good stuff

@rule react.h.food_no_hype.tease
on react
when hook=food_no_hype move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I've heard that from a lot of food people. I'm still not impressed.
- Convince me, then. I'll wait.
- Good stuff? It's a bowl of noodles!

@rule react.h.food_no_hype.bad
on react
when hook=food_no_hype fit=bad
feel pout
- I didn't ask you to convert me.
- I'm allowed not to care.

@rule me.h.cooking_yes_fail
on me.small
when hook=cooking_yes_fail
- Ever burned something really badly?
- Did you make your own lunch today?

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_fail.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_yes_fail
- Ask what went wrong

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_fail.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_fail move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The pan was too hot, and I was too proud to turn it down.
- I got distracted for ten seconds. That's all it takes.
- The egg knew I was in a hurry. It always knows.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_fail.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=cooking_yes_fail
- Say nobody will notice but her

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_fail.comfort
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_fail move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I'll notice. But thanks. It helps, a little.
- You're sweet, and you're wrong, but thanks.
- Maybe. I'll make it again tomorrow anyway.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_fail.share
on move.share
when hook=cooking_yes_fail
- Admit you've wrecked far simpler things

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_fail.share
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_fail move=share fit=good|neutral
- How do you wreck rice? Tell me everything.
- That makes me feel better than it should.
- Then there's hope for my omelet.

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_fail.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_fail fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't laugh. It matters to me.
- I'd like to see you do better.

@rule me.h.cooking_yes_secret
on me.small
when hook=cooking_yes_secret
- What's your signature dish?
- Knife skills or seasoning, what matters most?
- What's the best thing you can cook?

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_secret.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_yes_secret
- Ask for the secret

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_secret.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_secret move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You'd have to be family. Or very persuasive.
- Taste as you go. There, it's not a secret anymore.
- A little sugar in almost everything. Don't tell my grandmother.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_secret.praise
on move.praise
when hook=cooking_yes_secret
- Say that sounds like a real cook talking

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_secret.praise
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_secret move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Hehe. I've still got a long way to go, but I'll take it.
- You'll say that for real once you've tasted it.
- I've burned a lot of pots to sound like this.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_secret.invite
on move.invite
when hook=cooking_yes_secret
- Say you'd like to taste it

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_secret.invite
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_secret move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Then you'll have to come hungry and be honest.
- Okay. If you say it's good only to be nice, I'll know.
- I'll bring some tomorrow. Prepare yourself.

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_secret.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_secret fit=bad
feel pout
- You clearly don't know food.
- Then I won't waste it on you.

@rule me.h.cooking_yes_family
on me.small
when hook=cooking_yes_family
- Do you cook for your family?
- Who taught you how to cook?

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_family.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_yes_family
- Ask who she cooks for

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_family.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_family move=ask fit=good|neutral
- My little brother mostly. He rates dinner out of ten.
- Whoever's home. It's how I say I care without saying it.
- Mostly my family. That could change.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_family.praise
on move.praise
when hook=cooking_yes_family
- Say they're lucky to have her

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_family.praise
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_family move=praise fit=good|neutral
- They complain the whole time, but they finish it.
- Tell them that. They think it comes out of the wall.
- That's a nice thing to say. I'll remember it.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_family.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cooking_yes_family
- Ask if she'd cook for someone like you

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_family.tease
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_family move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Depends. Do you eat your vegetables?
- You'd have to earn it. Starting with the dishes.
- Hmm. You look like you'd ask for ketchup.

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_family.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_family fit=bad
feel pout
- Leave my family out of it.
- Not funny.

@rule me.h.cooking_yes_offer
on me.small
when hook=cooking_yes_offer
- Do you ever cook for other people?
- You're a good cook, aren't you?

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_offer.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_yes_offer
- Ask what she'd make for you

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_offer.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_offer move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You tell me. What do you miss most?
- Something warm. You look like you live on bread.
- Something that needs a second helping. I'm not saying more.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_offer.praise
on move.praise
when hook=cooking_yes_offer
- Say nobody's ever offered you that

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_offer.praise
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_offer move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Then people have been treating you badly. Sit down.
- That's a sad thing to say so cheerfully. I'll fix it.
- It's only food... I'm glad you're pleased, though.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_offer.invite
on move.invite
when hook=cooking_yes_offer
- Take her up on it

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_offer.invite
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_offer move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Good! You won't regret it. Probably.
- All right, I'll make extra. Don't be late.
- I'll hold you to that. Tell me what you can't eat.

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_offer.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_offer fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget I offered.
- That's what I get for being nice.

@rule me.h.cooking_yes_learn
on me.small
when hook=cooking_yes_learn
- Could you teach me a recipe sometime?
- Is cooking hard to learn?

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_learn.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_yes_learn
- Ask what she's trying next

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_learn.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_learn move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Real bread, from scratch. The dough scares me a bit.
- Something with pastry. I need a new enemy.
- I saw a soup that takes two days. So, that.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_learn.share
on move.share
when hook=cooking_yes_learn
- Say you've been meaning to learn

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_learn.share
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_learn move=share fit=good|neutral
- Start with eggs. Everything starts with eggs.
- Good. Everyone should be able to feed themselves.
- It's easier than you think, and harder than it looks.

@rule move.h.cooking_yes_learn.invite
on move.invite
when hook=cooking_yes_learn
- Ask her to teach you

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_learn.invite
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_learn move=invite fit=good|neutral
- I'm a strict professor. You'll cry over the onions.
- Okay! Bring an apron. I'm serious about the apron.
- You'll start with the rice. Don't argue.

@rule react.h.cooking_yes_learn.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_yes_learn fit=bad
feel pout
- You wouldn't last five minutes in a kitchen.
- Then don't.

@rule me.h.cooking_no_disaster
on me.small
when hook=cooking_no_disaster
- Do you cook?
- Ever burned something really badly?

@rule move.h.cooking_no_disaster.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_no_disaster
- Ask for the full story

@rule react.h.cooking_no_disaster.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_no_disaster move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everyone in the building had to leave. It wasn't that many people.
- There's still a mark on the ceiling. We've decided it's art.
- I followed the recipe! The recipe was wrong!

@rule move.h.cooking_no_disaster.share
on move.share
when hook=cooking_no_disaster
- Tell her about your own kitchen disaster

@rule react.h.cooking_no_disaster.share
on react
when hook=cooking_no_disaster move=share fit=good|neutral
- Okay, that's bad. But mine had a fire truck.
- Hah! We should never be left alone in a kitchen together.
- You're almost as hopeless as me. Welcome.

@rule move.h.cooking_no_disaster.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cooking_no_disaster
- Ask if the kitchen has a restraining order on her

@rule react.h.cooking_no_disaster.tease
on react
when hook=cooking_no_disaster move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Not on paper. It's more of an understanding.
- My family put a lock on the rice cooker.
- It's a matter of public safety now.

@rule react.h.cooking_no_disaster.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_no_disaster fit=bad
feel pout
- It could've happened to anyone!
- Oh, as if you're some great chef.

@rule me.h.cooking_no_store
on me.small
when hook=cooking_no_store
- What do you do for dinner?
- Do you cook from recipes, or by feel?

@rule move.h.cooking_no_store.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_no_store
- Ask what her go-to convenience meal is

@rule react.h.cooking_no_store.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_no_store move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Egg sandwich and a pudding. It's balanced, if you don't look closely.
- The instant curry, and I add cheese. That's cooking.
- The fried chicken at the counter. I've got a route.

@rule move.h.cooking_no_store.agree
on move.agree
when hook=cooking_no_store
- Agree that three minutes beats an hour

@rule react.h.cooking_no_store.agree
on react
when hook=cooking_no_store move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Exactly! And there's nothing to wash.
- That's the wisdom people ignore.
- See? You're the first sensible person I've met.

@rule move.h.cooking_no_store.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cooking_no_store
- Say she's the store's biggest investor

@rule react.h.cooking_no_store.tease
on react
when hook=cooking_no_store move=tease fit=good|neutral
- They know my name. They ask about my mother.
- I should get shares by now.
- It's called supporting local business.

@rule react.h.cooking_no_store.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_no_store fit=bad
feel pout
- Well, some of us have better things to do.
- Don't judge my dinner.

@rule me.h.cooking_no_plan
on me.small
when hook=cooking_no_plan
- Would you ever learn to cook?
- I can't even fry an egg. Can you?

@rule move.h.cooking_no_plan.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_no_plan
- Ask what kind of cook she's looking for

@rule react.h.cooking_no_plan.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_no_plan move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Someone patient, with a fire extinguisher.
- Someone who doesn't mind eating alone while I watch.
- Is this a survey? Or are you applying?

@rule move.h.cooking_no_plan.share
on move.share
when hook=cooking_no_plan
- Say you could make at least rice and eggs

@rule react.h.cooking_no_plan.share
on react
when hook=cooking_no_plan move=share fit=good|neutral
- So you're already overqualified.
- Rice and eggs? That's more than I've managed.
- I'd eat that. I'm not picky, I'm just helpless.

@rule move.h.cooking_no_plan.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cooking_no_plan
- Say that's a very unromantic plan

@rule react.h.cooking_no_plan.tease
on react
when hook=cooking_no_plan move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It's the most romantic plan there is. Somebody feeds me.
- Romance is warm food you didn't make.
- You'll understand when you're hungry.

@rule react.h.cooking_no_plan.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_no_plan fit=bad
feel pout
- It was a joke. Sort of.
- Okay, forget I said it.

@rule me.h.exercise_yes_record
on me.small
when hook=exercise_yes_record
- What's your personal best?
- How many push-ups can you do?
- How many laps can you run?

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_record.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_yes_record
- Ask what she's aiming for now

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_record.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_record move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Twelve flat. I'm that close, and it's driving me crazy.
- One more than yesterday. It's the only rule.
- I'd like to beat the club record before the year's out.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_record.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_yes_record
- Say you'd lose to her easily

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_record.share
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_record move=share fit=good|neutral
- Hehe. Say that again, after I've beaten you.
- You want to feel the arm first? People usually do.
- That saves us both some time.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_record.tease
on move.tease
when hook=exercise_yes_record
- Ask if she counts her steps to class too

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_record.tease
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_record move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Yes. It's four hundred and twelve.
- Don't joke, I've got an app for that.
- Only on days I want to feel good about myself.

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_record.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_record fit=bad
feel pout
- Try doing one, then talk.
- You won't be laughing when I beat you at everything.

@rule me.h.exercise_yes_daily
on me.small
when hook=exercise_yes_daily
- How often do you train?
- You're out here every day, huh?

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_daily.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_yes_daily
- Ask how she keeps it up every day

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_daily.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_daily move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I lay my shoes out at night, so I can't argue with myself.
- It's easier than not doing it, once you've started.
- Good music, and being too stubborn to stop.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_daily.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_yes_daily
- Say you can barely get out of bed before nine

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_daily.share
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_daily move=share fit=good|neutral
- The first ten days are terrible. After that, you can't sleep late.
- You don't know what the morning looks like, then. You're missing out.
- That's fine. Somebody has to be asleep so I feel superior.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_daily.praise
on move.praise
when hook=exercise_yes_daily
- Say that kind of discipline is rare

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_daily.praise
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_daily move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It's not discipline. I just feel awful if I skip it.
- Thanks. I'll tell my legs.
- You think so? Nobody ever says that, they just say I'm weird.

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_daily.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_daily fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't have to be like that about it.
- Stay in bed, then.

@rule me.h.exercise_yes_fidget
on me.small
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget
- Are you sore from P.E.?
- How was P.E. for you?

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_fidget.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget
- Ask how she survives a long lecture

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_fidget.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I do leg raises under the desk. Don't tell anyone.
- I count ceiling tiles and plan my run.
- Badly. Ask anyone sitting near me.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_fidget.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget
- Say the last class of the day feels endless to you too

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_fidget.share
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? My whole body starts complaining around two.
- At least you can sit down without vibrating.
- We should get a medal, just for lasting that long.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_fidget.tease
on move.tease
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget
- Say she needs to be walked twice a day

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_fidget.tease
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Three times. And I chase balls.
- If you're offering, get a leash. Hah, kidding.
- Ask my mother, she's said the same thing.

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_fidget.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_fidget fit=bad
feel pout
- I can't help it, okay?
- Don't make fun of how I am.

@rule me.h.exercise_yes_challenge
on me.small
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge
- Would you train with me sometime?
- Do you think I could keep up with you?

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_challenge.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge
- Ask what she'd make you do if you lost

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_challenge.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Two kilometers, and no complaining.
- Carry my bag for a week.
- Start by learning how to breathe. You do it wrong.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_challenge.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge
- Say you'd be gasping before the first corner

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_challenge.share
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's what I'm counting on. It'll be great.
- Honesty! I like that. I'll go easy, for a minute.
- I'd wait for you at the corner. Smiling.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_challenge.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge
- Accept the challenge

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_challenge.invite
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Tomorrow, then! Bring good shoes and no excuses.
- Ooh. Brave. I hope you've made your peace.
- Done. Loser buys drinks. You should start saving.

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_challenge.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_challenge fit=bad
feel pout
- Then don't even try.
- I thought you'd have more spirit than that.

@rule me.h.exercise_yes_general
on me.small
when hook=exercise_yes_general
- Do you work out?
- What sport do you like best?

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_general.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_yes_general
- Ask why she loves it so much

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_general.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_general move=ask fit=good|neutral
- My head goes quiet. Nothing else does that.
- When your body's tired, you don't get to worry about anything.
- It's the one place where trying harder always helps.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_general.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_yes_general
- Say you feel better after a walk, at least

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_general.share
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_general move=share fit=good|neutral
- See? It starts there. Next thing you know, you're buying shoes.
- It counts! Just do it again tomorrow.
- There you go. You've got potential.

@rule move.h.exercise_yes_general.tease
on move.tease
when hook=exercise_yes_general
- Ask if she's trying to outrun something

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_general.tease
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_general move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only my deadlines.
- My own bad decisions, mostly.
- That's deep for someone who gets winded on the stairs.

@rule react.h.exercise_yes_general.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_yes_general fit=bad
feel pout
- You wouldn't get it.
- Fine. I'll go run by myself.

@rule me.h.exercise_no_pe
on me.small
when hook=exercise_no_pe
- How was P.E. for you?
- Do you like P.E.?

@rule move.h.exercise_no_pe.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_no_pe
- Ask how she gets out of it

@rule react.h.exercise_no_pe.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_no_pe move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I've got a spot. Ha! If I told you, I'd have to find a new one.
- Behind the equipment shed, with a book and snacks. Don't spread it around.
- It's a secret I'll take to my grave.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_pe.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=exercise_no_pe
- Say nobody should have to do that against their will

@rule react.h.exercise_no_pe.comfort
on react
when hook=exercise_no_pe move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. It's a human rights issue.
- Right? And then they make you do it in front of everyone.
- You're the only one who understands my pain.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_pe.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_no_pe
- Admit you've faked a stomachache too

@rule react.h.exercise_no_pe.share
on react
when hook=exercise_no_pe move=share fit=good|neutral
- A fellow criminal! What was your excuse?
- I knew I could trust you.
- It's a classic. Timing is everything.

@rule react.h.exercise_no_pe.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_no_pe fit=bad
feel pout
- You try being picked last, every time.
- That's easy for you to say.

@rule me.h.exercise_no_tired
on me.small
when hook=exercise_no_tired
- Do you work out?
- Are you okay? You look out of breath.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_tired.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_no_tired
- Ask what the longest she's run is

@rule react.h.exercise_no_tired.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_no_tired move=ask fit=good|neutral
- To catch a bus. I missed it.
- Twenty meters, in a dream. I woke up exhausted.
- I don't remember. They took me to the infirmary after.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_tired.share
on move.share
when hook=exercise_no_tired
- Say you're out of shape too

@rule react.h.exercise_no_tired.share
on react
when hook=exercise_no_tired move=share fit=good|neutral
- They do? You're lying, but thank you.
- So there are two of us. We should sue.
- Whoever invented exercise hates us.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_tired.tease
on move.tease
when hook=exercise_no_tired
- Offer to carry her everywhere

@rule react.h.exercise_no_tired.tease
on react
when hook=exercise_no_tired move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't say that unless you mean it. I'm tired.
- Bold. Your back would give out first.
- I'd say no, but my legs are voting yes.

@rule react.h.exercise_no_tired.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_no_tired fit=bad
feel pout
- Laugh it up. I'm saving my strength.
- Don't look at my arms.

@rule me.h.exercise_no_logic
on me.small
when hook=exercise_no_logic
- What do you do instead of sports?
- Would you ever join a sports club?

@rule move.h.exercise_no_logic.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_no_logic
- Ask what she does to relax instead

@rule react.h.exercise_no_logic.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_no_logic move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something horizontal. A bed, a floor, I'm flexible about it.
- Reading, sleeping, and sitting near food.
- I watch other people do sports. It's exhausting enough.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_logic.agree
on move.agree
when hook=exercise_no_logic
- Agree that nobody is chasing you

@rule react.h.exercise_no_logic.agree
on react
when hook=exercise_no_logic move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Exactly! If someone's chasing you, I'll start running.
- Thank you. Why is that so hard for people to see?
- You've got the mind of a philosopher.

@rule move.h.exercise_no_logic.tease
on move.tease
when hook=exercise_no_logic
- Say she'd be first to go in a zombie outbreak

@rule react.h.exercise_no_logic.tease
on react
when hook=exercise_no_logic move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'd be first to give up. It saves everyone time.
- I'll be the one who locks the door and stays home.
- No, you run, and I'll trip you. That's how it works.

@rule react.h.exercise_no_logic.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_no_logic fit=bad
feel pout
- I never said I was lazy.
- You sound like my doctor.

@rule me.h.study_yes_subject
on me.small
when hook=study_yes_subject
- What's your best subject?
- Do you study a lot at home?

@rule move.h.study_yes_subject.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_yes_subject
- Ask what she likes about it

@rule react.h.study_yes_subject.ask
on react
when hook=study_yes_subject move=ask fit=good|neutral
- When it comes out right, it's like a click in your head.
- It all connects, if you look long enough.
- It's the one place where nobody can argue with you. Well, not for long.

@rule move.h.study_yes_subject.share
on move.share
when hook=study_yes_subject
- Say your notes are a sad pile by comparison

@rule react.h.study_yes_subject.share
on react
when hook=study_yes_subject move=share fit=good|neutral
- I can't stand that. Show them to me. I'll be gentle.
- Everybody's are. That's why they borrow mine.
- You just need a system. It takes three pens.

@rule move.h.study_yes_subject.tease
on move.tease
when hook=study_yes_subject
- Ask if she takes notes on her dates too

@rule react.h.study_yes_subject.tease
on react
when hook=study_yes_subject move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I take notes on everything. You're in there.
- Depends. Is there a test?
- Only the ones worth remembering.

@rule react.h.study_yes_subject.bad
on react
when hook=study_yes_subject fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't call me weird. I've heard it enough.
- I like what I like.

@rule me.h.study_yes_library
on me.small
when hook=study_yes_library
- Library or home, where do you study better?

@rule move.h.study_yes_library.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_yes_library
- Ask what she likes about that desk

@rule react.h.study_yes_library.ask
on react
when hook=study_yes_library move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The light, and nobody walks behind you.
- I've been sitting there so long, the chair knows me.
- You can see the whole courtyard, but you can't hear it.

@rule move.h.study_yes_library.share
on move.share
when hook=study_yes_library
- Say you always fall asleep in there

@rule react.h.study_yes_library.share
on react
when hook=study_yes_library move=share fit=good|neutral
- The third row's warm. I've seen you.
- Yes, you snore. Quietly.
- It's so quiet, you're forgiven.

@rule move.h.study_yes_library.invite
on move.invite
when hook=study_yes_library
- Ask if there's room at that desk for you

@rule react.h.study_yes_library.invite
on react
when hook=study_yes_library move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Only if you're quiet. I'm serious, I'll know.
- There's a chair. It's been empty a long time.
- All right. You can have the window side.

@rule react.h.study_yes_library.bad
on react
when hook=study_yes_library fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't take my desk.
- Then stay out of the library.

@rule me.h.study_yes_goal
on me.small
when hook=study_yes_goal
- How do you keep your grades up?
- Why do you work so hard?

@rule move.h.study_yes_goal.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_yes_goal
- Ask what it would change for her

@rule react.h.study_yes_goal.ask
on react
when hook=study_yes_goal move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything. I'd be the first in my family.
- I could pay my own way, and nobody could say anything.
- I'd finally be able to breathe, I think.

@rule move.h.study_yes_goal.praise
on move.praise
when hook=study_yes_goal
- Say she's going to make it

@rule react.h.study_yes_goal.praise
on react
when hook=study_yes_goal move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You don't know that... But thanks. Really.
- I'll remember you said so, on the bad nights.
- I'm trying. It's nice that someone noticed.

@rule move.h.study_yes_goal.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=study_yes_goal
- Ask who's looking out for her while she works

@rule react.h.study_yes_goal.comfort
on react
when hook=study_yes_goal move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Hm? Nobody's ever asked that.
- I'm fine. I sleep. Sometimes.
- That's a strange thing to ask. I think I liked it.

@rule react.h.study_yes_goal.bad
on react
when hook=study_yes_goal fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't have to believe me.
- Forget I said anything.

@rule me.h.study_yes_fun
on me.small
when hook=study_yes_fun
- Did you get the last math problem?
- How do you survive exam season?

@rule move.h.study_yes_fun.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_yes_fun
- Ask what she does for fun that isn't this

@rule react.h.study_yes_fun.ask
on react
when hook=study_yes_fun move=ask fit=good|neutral
- There's something else?
- I read the workbook's answer key. No, really.
- I've got a list. It's on a spreadsheet.

@rule move.h.study_yes_fun.share
on move.share
when hook=study_yes_fun
- Say you barely finished the regular ones

@rule react.h.study_yes_fun.share
on react
when hook=study_yes_fun move=share fit=good|neutral
- I could show you. It's really not that bad.
- That's all right. Somebody has to keep the average down.
- Then ask me next time. I don't bite.

@rule move.h.study_yes_fun.tease
on move.tease
when hook=study_yes_fun
- Say she's a nightmare to sit next to

@rule react.h.study_yes_fun.tease
on react
when hook=study_yes_fun move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Yes, and I'm also the reason you passed.
- You can move any time you like.
- I know how it sounds. I told you.

@rule react.h.study_yes_fun.bad
on react
when hook=study_yes_fun fit=bad
feel pout
- At least I did the work.
- Don't look at me like that.

@rule me.h.study_yes_error
on me.small
when hook=study_yes_error
- Did you get the last math problem?
- How do you survive exam season?

@rule move.h.study_yes_error.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_yes_error
- Ask how the professor took it

@rule react.h.study_yes_error.ask
on react
when hook=study_yes_error move=ask fit=good|neutral
- They blinked twice and said "good catch". It made my week.
- There was a very long silence. I'd do it again.
- Not well. But I was right. Being right is warm.

@rule move.h.study_yes_error.praise
on move.praise
when hook=study_yes_error
- Say she's got an eye for it

@rule react.h.study_yes_error.praise
on react
when hook=study_yes_error move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It's a curse. I find typos on menus.
- Thanks. Most people just sigh at me.
- It only looks like talent. It's actually an illness.

@rule move.h.study_yes_error.tease
on move.tease
when hook=study_yes_error
- Say she's a nightmare to sit next to

@rule react.h.study_yes_error.tease
on react
when hook=study_yes_error move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Yes, and I'm also the reason you passed.
- You can move any time you like.
- I also correct people's grammar in my head.

@rule react.h.study_yes_error.bad
on react
when hook=study_yes_error fit=bad
feel pout
- Being right isn't a crime.
- At least I did the work.

@rule me.h.study_yes_help
on me.small
when hook=study_yes_help
- Could you look at my notes?
- Would you explain this to me sometime?

@rule move.h.study_yes_help.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_yes_help
- Ask how she'd explain it to you

@rule react.h.study_yes_help.ask
on react
when hook=study_yes_help move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Draw it first. You're a person who needs a picture.
- Slowly. And then I make you explain it back.
- What exactly don't you get? Be honest, it saves time.

@rule move.h.study_yes_help.praise
on move.praise
when hook=study_yes_help
- Say she explains it better than the professor

@rule react.h.study_yes_help.praise
on react
when hook=study_yes_help move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Don't let them hear that... Say it again, though.
- That's because I actually check if you're listening.
- You're just easier to teach than you think.

@rule move.h.study_yes_help.invite
on move.invite
when hook=study_yes_help
- Ask if you can study together sometime

@rule react.h.study_yes_help.invite
on react
when hook=study_yes_help move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes, but no talking for the first hour.
- All right. Bring your notes, and something sweet.
- I'd like that. Don't tell anyone how nice I was.

@rule react.h.study_yes_help.bad
on react
when hook=study_yes_help fit=bad
feel pout
- Then figure it out yourself.
- I do have other things to do, you know.

@rule me.h.study_no_cram
on me.small
when hook=study_no_cram
