on move.ask
when hook=study_no_cram
- Ask how she's still passing

@rule react.h.study_no_cram.ask
on react
when hook=study_no_cram move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Luck, and a very kind person in the second row.
- I've got a system. It's called panic.
- I'm not sure. Please don't look into it.

@rule move.h.study_no_cram.share
on move.share
when hook=study_no_cram
- Say you've pulled a few all-nighters yourself

@rule react.h.study_no_cram.share
on react
when hook=study_no_cram move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then you know that sunrise. The sunrise of regret.
- So we're both doomed. That's comforting.
- Good. We can sit together and fail.

@rule move.h.study_no_cram.tease
on move.tease
when hook=study_no_cram
- Ask whose notes she's stealing this time

@rule react.h.study_no_cram.tease
on react
when hook=study_no_cram move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Yours, if you take better ones.
- Everyone's. I'm very fair.
- Stealing is such a strong word.

@rule react.h.study_no_cram.bad
on react
when hook=study_no_cram fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't tell the professor. I mean it.
- As if you've never done it.

@rule me.h.study_no_fail
on me.small
when hook=study_no_fail
- Which subject do you hate?
- How did the last test go?

@rule move.h.study_no_fail.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_no_fail
- Ask how bad it really was

@rule react.h.study_no_fail.ask
on react
when hook=study_no_fail move=ask fit=good|neutral
- There was a zero. It had a little comment beside it.
- Very. My pen ran out of hope around question four.
- I've folded it into a very small square.

@rule move.h.study_no_fail.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=study_no_fail
- Say one test doesn't decide anything

@rule react.h.study_no_fail.comfort
on react
when hook=study_no_fail move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Try telling that to my mom. But thanks.
- I know. It still stings a little.
- You're nice. Don't get used to me admitting that.

@rule move.h.study_no_fail.share
on move.share
when hook=study_no_fail
- Tell her your own worst score

@rule react.h.study_no_fail.share
on react
when hook=study_no_fail move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh, that's terrible! I feel so much better now.
- That low? We should start a club.
- Thank you for your sacrifice.

@rule react.h.study_no_fail.bad
on react
when hook=study_no_fail fit=bad
feel pout
- That hurt, you know.
- Yeah, yeah. Go ahead, laugh.

@rule me.h.study_no_why
on me.small
when hook=study_no_why
- How's the studying going?
- Is there any subject you can't stand?

@rule move.h.study_no_why.ask
on move.ask
when hook=study_no_why
- Ask what she'd do with the time instead

@rule react.h.study_no_why.ask
on react
when hook=study_no_why move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sleep, eat, and stare at the sea. In that order.
- Literally anything that doesn't have a test at the end.
- Live. I've heard it's nice.

@rule move.h.study_no_why.agree
on move.agree
when hook=study_no_why
- Agree you'll never use half of it

@rule react.h.study_no_why.agree
on react
when hook=study_no_why move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Thank you! When was the last time you solved for x at a shop?
- Finally, somebody honest.
- Say that in front of the math professor. I'll watch.

@rule move.h.study_no_why.tease
on move.tease
when hook=study_no_why
- Say her brain just needs a reboot

@rule react.h.study_no_why.tease
on react
when hook=study_no_why move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It's been loading since April.
- Unplug it and leave it for a week, then.
- There's no warranty on this thing, sadly.

@rule react.h.study_no_why.bad
on react
when hook=study_no_why fit=bad
feel pout
- I'm not stupid, you know.
- Don't you start too.

