when hook=fashion_yes_saving
- Ask what she's got her eye on

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_saving.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_saving move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A beige coat. It's perfect, and it costs about what I have.
- There's a bag. I visit it. It knows me.
- You'd only laugh at the price.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_saving.share
on move.share
when hook=fashion_yes_saving
- Say you've worn the same jacket for three years

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_saving.share
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_saving move=share fit=good|neutral
- I noticed. We need to talk about it.
- Three years? Poor thing. It deserves a rest.
- That's not a jacket, that's a cry for help.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_saving.invite
on move.invite
when hook=fashion_yes_saving
- Offer to carry the bags for her

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_saving.invite
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_saving move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'll regret that offer by the second floor.
- Hired! The pay is my opinion on your shoes.
- Careful. I don't get tired in shops.

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_saving.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_saving fit=bad
feel pout
- It's my money.
- You wouldn't understand.

@rule me.h.fashion_yes_stylist
on me.small
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist
- You always look put together.
- You know a lot about clothes, huh?

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_stylist.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist
- Ask what she'd design first

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_stylist.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Coats. A good coat changes how you walk.
- Something you could actually wear to class.
- A whole line, with pockets that hold things.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_stylist.praise
on move.praise
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist
- Say she's got a real eye for it

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_stylist.praise
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You think? I've been told it's a phase.
- That's what I wanted to hear. Say it to my mom.
- Then you've got a better eye than I thought.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_stylist.invite
on move.invite
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist
- Ask to see some of her work

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_stylist.invite
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Okay... don't look at the early pages.
- Only if you tell me the truth.
- I don't show those to many people. All right.

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_stylist.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_stylist fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not just playing dress-up.
- Never mind.

@rule me.h.fashion_yes_mine
on me.small
when hook=fashion_yes_mine
- Did you do something different today?
- Is that new?

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_mine.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fashion_yes_mine
- Ask where she got it

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_mine.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_mine move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A tiny shop behind the station. Don't tell anyone.
- It was on sale, and it was the last one.
- My sister's. She doesn't know yet.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_mine.praise
on move.praise
when hook=fashion_yes_mine
- Say you noticed right away

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_mine.praise
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_mine move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You did? Finally, someone with eyes.
- That's all I wanted to hear.
- Hehe. You're paying attention.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_mine.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fashion_yes_mine
- Say you only noticed because she told you

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_mine.tease
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_mine move=tease fit=good|neutral
- That still counts. I'm taking it.
- I'll accept that. It's better than nothing.
- You're terrible.

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_mine.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_mine fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget I said anything.
- Nobody looks anyway.

@rule me.h.fashion_yes_you
on me.small
when hook=fashion_yes_you
- How do I look today?
- What would you change about my outfit?

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_you.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fashion_yes_you
- Ask what she'd change about you

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_you.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_you move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The shoes first. No, don't look at them, it's too late.
- Hold still. A darker color, and a shirt that fits.
- Honestly? Not much. Just stand up straighter.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_you.praise
on move.praise
when hook=fashion_yes_you
- Say you trust her taste more than yours

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_you.praise
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_you move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Good. That's the first step.
- That's wise. I wouldn't trust yours either.
- Then come with me someday. I've got ideas.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_you.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fashion_yes_you
- Ask if she's checking you out

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_you.tease
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_you move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Purely professional interest... Mostly.
- Don't flatter yourself, I look at everybody's collar.
- And if I am?

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_you.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_you fit=bad
feel pout
- Fine. Keep looking like that.
- I was only trying to help.

@rule me.h.fashion_yes_feeling
on me.small
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling
- If you weren't in class, what would you wear?
- Do clothes matter that much to you?

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_feeling.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling
- Ask what she wears on a bad day

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_feeling.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something loud. If I feel bad, I want to look great.
- My red scarf. It's never let me down.
- Whatever makes me stand up straight.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_feeling.share
on move.share
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling
- Say you never gave it much thought

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_feeling.share
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling move=share fit=good|neutral
- I can tell. That's okay, you've got me.
- It's not too late. There's always hope.
- Try wearing something you like, once. You'll see.

@rule move.h.fashion_yes_feeling.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling
- Ask how long she spends in front of the mirror

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_feeling.tease
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Less time than you think. More than I'd admit.
- It takes effort to look this effortless.
- I've got a schedule, and it's nobody's business.

@rule react.h.fashion_yes_feeling.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_yes_feeling fit=bad
feel pout
- At least I try.
- You don't have to mock it.

@rule me.h.fashion_no_shop
on me.small
when hook=fashion_no_shop
