- Where do you buy your clothes?

@rule move.h.fashion_no_shop.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fashion_no_shop
- Ask when she last went shopping

@rule react.h.fashion_no_shop.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_no_shop move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Last month. Three hours by a fountain. I aged.
- They made me try things on. I don't want to talk about it.
- I came back with socks. I needed socks.

@rule move.h.fashion_no_shop.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=fashion_no_shop
- Offer to rescue her next time

@rule react.h.fashion_no_shop.comfort
on react
when hook=fashion_no_shop move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You'd be a hero. There's a statue in it for you.
- Next time, I'll text you a code word.
- You don't know how much that means.

@rule move.h.fashion_no_shop.agree
on move.agree
when hook=fashion_no_shop
- Say malls are a trap

@rule react.h.fashion_no_shop.agree
on react
when hook=fashion_no_shop move=agree fit=good|neutral
