- Thank you. It doesn't even have pockets.
- Exactly. I'd rather spend that on lunch.

@rule react.h.fashion_no_shop.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_no_shop fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't care what you think I should wear.
- Don't drag me to the mall.

@rule me.h.fashion_no_plain
on me.small
when hook=fashion_no_plain
- Got a favorite brand?
- What's in style these days?

@rule move.h.fashion_no_plain.ask
