@rule react.h.fashion_no_plain.agree
on react
when hook=fashion_no_plain move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Finally, someone with common sense.
- If it doesn't have a waistband that gives, I'm not interested.
- I knew you were one of the good ones.

@rule move.h.fashion_no_plain.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fashion_no_plain
- Say even her hoodies look tired

@rule react.h.fashion_no_plain.tease
on react
