- I look fine.

@rule me.h.coffee_yes_cafe
on me.small
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe
- Do you have a favorite café?
- Where do you get your coffee?

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_cafe.ask
on move.ask
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe
- Ask what her usual is there

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_cafe.ask
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Single origin, black. The owner doesn't even ask anymore.
- Whatever he's roasting that week. I trust him.
- The house blend. And the seat by the window, if I'm lucky.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_cafe.share
on move.share
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe
- Say you usually grab whatever's in the vending machine

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_cafe.share
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh, that hurts to hear.
- We'll get you help. There's still time.
- That's not coffee. That's a warm apology.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_cafe.invite
on move.invite
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe
- Ask her to take you there

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_cafe.invite
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Okay. Don't ask for sugar in front of the owner.
- Yes. You'll drink it black, and you'll like it.
- My treat, the first time. After that, you're on your own.

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_cafe.bad
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_cafe fit=bad
feel pout
- Then stay with your vending machine.
- You wouldn't taste the difference anyway.

@rule me.h.coffee_yes_craft
on me.small
when hook=coffee_yes_craft
