- How do you take your coffee?

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_craft.ask
on move.ask
when hook=coffee_yes_craft
- Ask how you'd tell a good cup from a bad one

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_craft.ask
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_craft move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A good one leaves you tasting something after it's gone.
- If you want sugar, it's a bad one.
- Smell it first. If it smells like a burnt pot, run.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_craft.praise
on move.praise
when hook=coffee_yes_craft
- Say she knows more than most café owners

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_craft.praise
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_craft move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Don't flatter me... Go on, though.
- I've made a lot of bad cups to know this.
- That's the nicest thing anyone's said about my kitchen.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_craft.tease
on move.tease
when hook=coffee_yes_craft
- Ask if she can taste the bean's childhood too

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_craft.tease
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_craft move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It had a hard childhood, and a soft finish.
- Laugh all you want, I can taste your attitude.
- Mock me after you've tried a real one.

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_craft.bad
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_craft fit=bad
feel pout
- Enjoy your milk and sugar.
- There's no talking to you.

@rule me.h.coffee_yes_morning
on me.small
when hook=coffee_yes_morning
