when hook=coffee_yes_morning
- Ask how many cups she's had today

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_morning.ask
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_morning move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Don't ask questions you can't handle.
- Two. Three. What day is it?
- Not enough, or we'd be having a better talk.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_morning.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=coffee_yes_morning
- Ask if she's sleeping at all

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_morning.comfort
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_morning move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Sometimes, briefly, with my eyes open.
- You're not my doctor... But not really. Thanks for asking.
- I'm fine. My hands only shake a little.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_morning.tease
on move.tease
when hook=coffee_yes_morning
- Say you can hear her heartbeat from here

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_morning.tease
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_morning move=tease fit=good|neutral
- That's rude. It's keeping perfect time.
- That's a normal speed for a person with goals.
- It's not me that's shaking, it's the world.

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_morning.bad
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_morning fit=bad
feel pout
- Give me a minute before you try that.
- I'm not awake enough for your jokes.

@rule me.h.coffee_yes_general
on me.small
when hook=coffee_yes_general
