@rule react.h.coffee_yes_general.ask
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_general move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A long night, and my father's cup left on the table.
- I wanted to look grown-up. Then I actually liked it.
- An all-nighter. I've never gone back.

@rule move.h.coffee_yes_general.share
on move.share
when hook=coffee_yes_general
- Say you've been meaning to try it properly

@rule react.h.coffee_yes_general.share
on react
when hook=coffee_yes_general move=share fit=good|neutral
