@rule react.h.coffee_no_alternative.invite
on react
when hook=coffee_no_alternative move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then make it the large one.
- You've found the way to my heart. It's sugar.
- Okay. But I'm choosing, and you can't judge.

@rule react.h.coffee_no_alternative.bad
on react
when hook=coffee_no_alternative fit=bad
