@rule react.h.sweets_yes_general.bad
on react
when hook=sweets_yes_general fit=bad
feel pout
- Say what you like. I won't share.
- Hmph.

@rule me.h.sweets_no_gifts
on me.small
when hook=sweets_no_gifts
- What do you do with the sweets people give you?
- What do you think of Valentine's?

@rule move.h.sweets_no_gifts.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sweets_no_gifts
- Ask who ends up with them

@rule react.h.sweets_no_gifts.ask
on react
when hook=sweets_no_gifts move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The girl who sits behind me. She thinks I'm a saint.
- My little sister. She thinks I'm very popular.
- Whoever's nearest. I'm not picky.

@rule move.h.sweets_no_gifts.share
on move.share
when hook=sweets_no_gifts
- Say you'd gladly take them off her hands

@rule react.h.sweets_no_gifts.share
on react
when hook=sweets_no_gifts move=share fit=good|neutral
- Done. You're my new garbage disposal.
- Good. There's a bag in my locker.
- You'd better eat them all.

@rule move.h.sweets_no_gifts.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sweets_no_gifts
- Say someone's going to take that personally

@rule react.h.sweets_no_gifts.tease
on react
when hook=sweets_no_gifts move=tease fit=good|neutral
- They can give me rice crackers next time.
- Then they should learn what I like.
- Let them. It's a test, and they failed.

@rule react.h.sweets_no_gifts.bad
on react
when hook=sweets_no_gifts fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not like I do it to be mean.
- Don't make me sound like a villain.

@rule me.h.sweets_no_salty
on me.small
when hook=sweets_no_salty
- Sweet or salty?
- What do you snack on?

@rule move.h.sweets_no_salty.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sweets_no_salty
- Ask what her perfect snack is

@rule react.h.sweets_no_salty.ask
on react
when hook=sweets_no_salty move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Rice crackers with soy sauce, and a cold tea.
- Salted peanuts, the kind that make you thirsty.
- Something crunchy, that doesn't apologize.

@rule move.h.sweets_no_salty.share
on move.share
when hook=sweets_no_salty
- Say you'd pick chips over cake too

@rule react.h.sweets_no_salty.share
on react
when hook=sweets_no_salty move=share fit=good|neutral
- Good. Then we can get along.
- I knew I could trust you.
- That's a rare thing to hear around here.

@rule move.h.sweets_no_salty.invite
on move.invite
when hook=sweets_no_salty
- Offer to split a bag of crackers

@rule react.h.sweets_no_salty.invite
on react
when hook=sweets_no_salty move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Now that's an invitation. I accept.
- You have a good sense of what matters.
- Yes. And don't you dare get the sweet ones.

@rule react.h.sweets_no_salty.bad
on react
when hook=sweets_no_salty fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't need to like cake.
- It's just what I like.

@rule me.h.sweets_no_sick
on me.small
when hook=sweets_no_sick
- Why don't you like sweets?
- Is there anything you can't eat?

@rule move.h.sweets_no_sick.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sweets_no_sick
- Ask what happened

@rule react.h.sweets_no_sick.ask
on react
when hook=sweets_no_sick move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Cotton candy, a festival, and a ride. In that order.
- Too much too young. I paid for it.
- My stomach has a long memory.

@rule move.h.sweets_no_sick.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=sweets_no_sick
- Say you won't push cake on her

@rule react.h.sweets_no_sick.comfort
on react
when hook=sweets_no_sick move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Thank you. You've no idea how rare that is.
- I appreciate that. People take it so personally.
- That's a relief. You pass.

@rule move.h.sweets_no_sick.tease
on move.tease
when hook=sweets_no_sick
- Say the cake misses her

@rule react.h.sweets_no_sick.tease
on react
when hook=sweets_no_sick move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It can miss me from over there.
- It knows what it did.
- We're seeing other snacks.

@rule react.h.sweets_no_sick.bad
on react
when hook=sweets_no_sick fit=bad
feel pout
- It really did make me sick, you know.
- Think whatever you like.

@rule me.h.club_leaving
on me.small
when hook=club_leaving
- Is the {club} meeting today?
- Busy at the {club} lately?

@rule move.h.club_leaving.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_leaving
- Ask what's on at the {club} today

@rule react.h.club_leaving.ask
on react
when hook=club_leaving move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nothing exciting. But if I'm late, I'll hear about it.
- A meeting that could've been a message.
- We're sorting out next month. I'm the one who has to write it down.

@rule move.h.club_leaving.share
on move.share
when hook=club_leaving
- Say you won't keep her then

@rule react.h.club_leaving.share
on react
when hook=club_leaving move=share fit=good|neutral
- Thanks. I'd have stayed, you know.
- You're nice. Talk later?
- I've got a minute. It's only that I should go.

@rule move.h.club_leaving.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_leaving
- Ask if the {club} would fall apart without her

@rule react.h.club_leaving.tease
on react
when hook=club_leaving move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Yes. It's a fact. Ask anyone.
- It'd take about a day.
- Don't make me say no.

@rule react.h.club_leaving.bad
on react
when hook=club_leaving fit=bad
feel pout
- Then I'm going.
- You're holding me up, you know.

@rule me.h.club_drama
on me.small
when hook=club_drama
- Do you get along with everyone at the {club}?
- Who's in charge of the {club}?

@rule move.h.club_drama.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_drama
- Ask what's going on at the {club}

@rule react.h.club_drama.ask
on react
when hook=club_drama move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Two people aren't talking, and we all have to pretend not to notice.
- Someone said something. Someone heard. You know how it is.
- It's too boring to explain, and too annoying to forget.

@rule move.h.club_drama.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=club_drama
- Say that sounds tiring

@rule react.h.club_drama.comfort
on react
when hook=club_drama move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It is. You'd think we'd get along, with so few of us.
- Thanks. It's nice to complain to someone outside it.
- A little. It'll pass.

@rule move.h.club_drama.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_drama
- Ask whose side she's on

@rule react.h.club_drama.tease
on react
when hook=club_drama move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Mine. I'm always on my side.
- Whoever brings the snacks.
- I'm the one with the popcorn, watching.

@rule react.h.club_drama.bad
on react
when hook=club_drama fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't go spreading that around.
- It isn't funny to the ones in it.

@rule me.h.club_why
on me.small
when hook=club_why
- How did you end up in the {club}?
- Why did you pick the {club}?

@rule move.h.club_why.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_why
- Ask what keeps her coming back

@rule react.h.club_why.ask
on react
when hook=club_why move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The people. And it's the one hour nobody needs me to be anything else.
- I honestly can't imagine my week without it.
- Habit, at first. Now I'd miss it.

@rule move.h.club_why.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_why
- Say you can tell it means a lot to her

@rule react.h.club_why.praise
on react
when hook=club_why move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Is it that obvious? Yeah. It does.
- You've got good eyes.
- I don't talk about it much. Thanks for noticing.

@rule move.h.club_why.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_why
- Ask if you could drop by the {club}

@rule react.h.club_why.invite
on react
when hook=club_why move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure! I'd like that. Don't mind the mess.
- Come on a good day, I'll show you around.
- Okay, but you can't laugh at anything.

@rule react.h.club_why.bad
on react
when hook=club_why fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it. It's not for you.
- I shouldn't bother explaining.

@rule me.h.club_busy
on me.small
when hook=club_busy
- How's the {club}?
- Any big plans for the {club}?

@rule move.h.club_busy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_busy
- Ask what the big thing coming up is

@rule react.h.club_busy.ask
on react
when hook=club_busy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- We're still working it out, but it's going to take every weekend.
- Something I'm not supposed to talk about yet.
- You'll know when it's up. Probably from the noise.

@rule move.h.club_busy.share
on move.share
when hook=club_busy
- Say you could use a place like that

@rule react.h.club_busy.share
on react
when hook=club_busy move=share fit=good|neutral
- You really could. You look like you need a hobby.
- There's room. There's always room.
- Then pick one! Life's too long for nothing but class.

@rule move.h.club_busy.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_busy
- Say you'd come and see it

@rule react.h.club_busy.invite
on react
when hook=club_busy move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Good. We need an audience, not just each other.
- You'd really come? Okay. I'll save you a seat.
- I'm holding you to that.

@rule react.h.club_busy.bad
on react
when hook=club_busy fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't bother, then.
- Don't come if you're going to be like that.

@rule me.h.club_sports_match
on me.small
when hook=club_sports_match
- Is the {club} doing anything soon?
- Are you the best one at the {club}?

@rule move.h.club_sports_match.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_sports_match
- Ask who she's most worried about

@rule react.h.club_sports_match.ask
on react
when hook=club_sports_match move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Their captain. She's terrifying, and she's nice about it.
- Myself, mostly. I freeze for the first minute.
- We'll see on the day. I'm not scared, I've decided.

@rule move.h.club_sports_match.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_sports_match
- Say you'd bet on her

@rule react.h.club_sports_match.praise
on react
when hook=club_sports_match move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Careful, I'd make you pay up.
- Then I can't lose now, can I?
- That helps more than you'd think. Thanks.

@rule move.h.club_sports_match.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_sports_match
- Say you'll be there to cheer

@rule react.h.club_sports_match.invite
on react
when hook=club_sports_match move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? I'll have to play well, now.
- Then be loud. Louder than the other side.
- Okay! I'll look for you in the stands.

@rule react.h.club_sports_match.bad
on react
when hook=club_sports_match fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't have to come.
- Then stay home.

@rule me.h.club_sports_hurts
on me.small
when hook=club_sports_hurts
- What's the hardest part of the {club}?
- What do you guys do at the {club}, anyway?

@rule move.h.club_sports_hurts.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_sports_hurts
- Ask what practice actually looks like

@rule react.h.club_sports_hurts.ask
on react
when hook=club_sports_hurts move=ask fit=good|neutral
- We run until someone cries, then we run some more.
- Drills, and yelling. I've started to like the yelling.
- Warm-up's already harder than your whole week.

@rule move.h.club_sports_hurts.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=club_sports_hurts
- Ask if she's getting any rest

@rule react.h.club_sports_hurts.comfort
on react
when hook=club_sports_hurts move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Rest? Is that what they call it?
- I sleep like a stone, at least. Thanks.
- I'll rest when it's over.

@rule move.h.club_sports_hurts.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_sports_hurts
- Ask if the bruises come with a medal

@rule react.h.club_sports_hurts.tease
on react
when hook=club_sports_hurts move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Yes, it's called "bruise".
- Feel free to look. Hah, no.
- I've named this one.

@rule react.h.club_sports_hurts.bad
on react
when hook=club_sports_hurts fit=bad
feel pout
- You try it, then.
- It's not funny when it's your legs.

@rule me.h.club_sports_win
on me.small
when hook=club_sports_win
- How's the {club}?
- Busy at the {club} lately?

@rule move.h.club_sports_win.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_sports_win
- Ask how much she's improved

@rule react.h.club_sports_win.ask
on react
when hook=club_sports_win move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A lot. I can feel it, even if the clock doesn't always agree.
- My best time's dropped. Don't tell the others yet.
- Enough that I stopped hating it.

@rule move.h.club_sports_win.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_sports_win
- Say all that work is showing

@rule react.h.club_sports_win.praise
on react
when hook=club_sports_win move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You noticed? Hehe. I'll take that.
- Thanks. It's good to hear it from outside the team.
- I told you it was worth it.

@rule move.h.club_sports_win.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_sports_win
- Say she'll retire before she's thirty

@rule react.h.club_sports_win.tease
on react
when hook=club_sports_win move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Then I'll coach, and make girls like me suffer.
- My knees agree with you.
- That's the plan. On a beach.

@rule react.h.club_sports_win.bad
on react
when hook=club_sports_win fit=bad
feel pout
- You've never played, have you?
- Fine. Watch from the bench.

@rule me.h.club_culture_festival
on me.small
when hook=club_culture_festival
- Is the {club} doing anything for the festival?
- Any big plans for the {club}?

@rule move.h.club_culture_festival.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_culture_festival
- Ask for a hint about what she's making

@rule react.h.club_culture_festival.ask
on react
when hook=club_culture_festival move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Not a chance. All right, it's big. That's your hint.
- I'll say this: it's taken over my room.
- You'll have to wait. It's only half-embarrassing so far.

@rule move.h.club_culture_festival.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_culture_festival
- Say you'd like to see it when it's done

@rule react.h.club_culture_festival.praise
on react
when hook=club_culture_festival move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then I've got to finish it.
- You'll be the first. Well, the second.
- Don't expect too much. But thanks.

@rule move.h.club_culture_festival.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_culture_festival
- Ask if they need a hand

@rule react.h.club_culture_festival.invite
on react
when hook=club_culture_festival move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Can you carry things? Then yes, you're hired.
- You'd do that? We never get help.
- There's always something to cut, glue or hold up.

@rule react.h.club_culture_festival.bad
on react
when hook=club_culture_festival fit=bad
feel pout
- Then don't look at it.
- I shouldn't have said anything.

@rule me.h.club_culture_budget
on me.small
when hook=club_culture_budget
- Does the {club} need more people?
- What's the hardest part of the {club}?

@rule move.h.club_culture_budget.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_culture_budget
- Ask what they'd do with a real budget

@rule react.h.club_culture_budget.ask
on react
when hook=club_culture_budget move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Chairs. We'd start with chairs that have all their legs.
- We'd finally stop sharing the one good pair of scissors.
- You don't want to know how long that list is.

@rule move.h.club_culture_budget.share
on move.share
when hook=club_culture_budget
- Say the sports clubs always get everything

@rule react.h.club_culture_budget.share
on react
when hook=club_culture_budget move=share fit=good|neutral
- Thank you! Three new balls, and we're begging for tape.
- You see it too? I thought I was just bitter.
- Say that at the next student union meeting.

@rule move.h.club_culture_budget.defend
on move.defend
when hook=club_culture_budget
- Say the {club} does more than people think

@rule react.h.club_culture_budget.defend
on react
when hook=club_culture_budget move=defend fit=good|neutral
- Finally! Tell that to the student union.
- I'll quote you on our next budget request.
- That's why I stay. Thanks for saying it.

@rule react.h.club_culture_budget.bad
on react
when hook=club_culture_budget fit=bad
feel pout
- At least we're trying.
- You sound just like the student union.

@rule me.h.club_culture_quiet
on me.small
when hook=club_culture_quiet
- How's the {club}?
- What do you guys do at the {club}, anyway?

@rule move.h.club_culture_quiet.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_culture_quiet
- Ask what it's like there after hours

@rule react.h.club_culture_quiet.ask
on react
when hook=club_culture_quiet move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Quiet. Somebody's kettle, the sound of pens.
- There's a smell of old paper and tea, and nobody needs anything.
- I've fallen asleep there more than once.

@rule move.h.club_culture_quiet.share
on move.share
when hook=club_culture_quiet
- Say you could use a quiet corner too

@rule react.h.club_culture_quiet.share
on react
when hook=club_culture_quiet move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then you know the place. There's a spare chair.
- You'd fit in. You just have to be okay with silence.
- Everyone could. Most people don't know it.

@rule move.h.club_culture_quiet.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_culture_quiet
- Ask if you could sit in sometime

@rule react.h.club_culture_quiet.invite
on react
when hook=club_culture_quiet move=invite fit=good|neutral
- If you bring snacks, nobody will even ask who you are.
- Yes. Just don't talk during the first hour.
- I'll tell them you're with me.

@rule react.h.club_culture_quiet.bad
on react
when hook=club_culture_quiet fit=bad
feel pout
- It wouldn't be quiet with you there.
- Forget I mentioned it.

@rule me.h.club_teacher_forms
on me.small
when hook=club_teacher_forms
- Are you advising a club this year?
- How's the club you look after?

@rule move.h.club_teacher_forms.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_teacher_forms
- Ask what an advisor actually does

@rule react.h.club_teacher_forms.ask
on react
when hook=club_teacher_forms move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Signs things, drives things, and hides the bills.
- Everything nobody else will. That's the whole job description.
- I sit in the corner and pretend not to worry.

@rule move.h.club_teacher_forms.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=club_teacher_forms
- Say they don't pay her enough for that

@rule react.h.club_teacher_forms.comfort
on react
when hook=club_teacher_forms move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- They really don't. You've no idea.
- Finally, someone who understands the budget.
- It's nice of you to notice.

@rule move.h.club_teacher_forms.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_teacher_forms
- Say she's just a very tired taxi driver

@rule react.h.club_teacher_forms.tease
on react
when hook=club_teacher_forms move=tease fit=good|neutral
- With a very bad salary, yes.
- I've got a loyalty card at the gas station.
- Yes, and tips are appreciated.

@rule react.h.club_teacher_forms.bad
on react
when hook=club_teacher_forms fit=bad
feel pout
- I'd like to see you do it.
- Don't start. It's been a long day.

@rule me.h.club_teacher_proud
on me.small
when hook=club_teacher_proud
- How's the club you look after?
- Do you like being an advisor?

@rule move.h.club_teacher_proud.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_teacher_proud
- Ask which student reminds her of herself

@rule react.h.club_teacher_proud.ask
on react
when hook=club_teacher_proud move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Don't make me name names. I'd never hear the end of it.
- The one who stays last and says it's nothing.
- There's always one. I worry about that one the most.

@rule move.h.club_teacher_proud.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_teacher_proud
- Say they're lucky to have her

@rule react.h.club_teacher_proud.praise
on react
when hook=club_teacher_proud move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Don't tell them. They'd stop trying.
- You're kind. I do what I can.
- They'd say otherwise, on a Monday.

@rule move.h.club_teacher_proud.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_teacher_proud
- Ask if you could help out at the {club}

@rule react.h.club_teacher_proud.invite
on react
when hook=club_teacher_proud move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You, volunteer? Who are you, and what have you done?
- I could use another pair of hands. Don't make me regret it.
- Yes, and I'll remember you offered.

@rule react.h.club_teacher_proud.bad
on react
when hook=club_teacher_proud fit=bad
feel pout
- You could at least try to be serious.
- That's enough of that.

@rule me.h.friend_crush
on me.small
when hook=friend_crush
- Is {bff} seeing anyone?
- What's {bff} like when nobody's around?

@rule move.h.friend_crush.ask
on move.ask
when hook=friend_crush
- Ask who she thinks it is

@rule react.h.friend_crush.ask
on react
when hook=friend_crush move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I've got a list of suspects. You're on it, by the way.
- She goes quiet whenever a certain name comes up.
- If I find out, I'm telling everyone. Kidding. Mostly.

@rule move.h.friend_crush.share
on move.share
when hook=friend_crush
- Say {bff} hides it well

@rule react.h.friend_crush.share
on react
when hook=friend_crush move=share fit=good|neutral
- From you, maybe. Not from me.
- She thinks so too. It's adorable.
- You didn't notice? You're worse at this than I thought.

@rule move.h.friend_crush.tease
on move.tease
when hook=friend_crush
- Ask if she's investigating on {bff} full-time

@rule react.h.friend_crush.tease
on react
when hook=friend_crush move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I've got a notebook. It's a real investigation.
- That's what best friends are for.
- Every good friend's a little bit of a spy.

@rule react.h.friend_crush.bad
on react
when hook=friend_crush fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't go telling her I said that.
- Forget I mentioned it.

@rule me.h.friend_text
on me.small
when hook=friend_text
- Have you seen {bff} today?
- What do you and {bff} even talk about?
- You look tired. Were you up late?

@rule move.h.friend_text.ask
on move.ask
when hook=friend_text
- Ask what the two of them go on about

@rule react.h.friend_text.ask
on react
when hook=friend_text move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nothing! That's the trick. It takes hours.
- Everything. Boys, food, whether fish can be sad.
- That's confidential. I signed something.

@rule move.h.friend_text.share
on move.share
when hook=friend_text
- Say you wish you had someone like that

@rule react.h.friend_text.share
on react
when hook=friend_text move=share fit=good|neutral
- You could. It only takes one person.
- It's the best. I hope you find one.
- You have me, for now. Don't get excited.

@rule move.h.friend_text.invite
on move.invite
when hook=friend_text
- Ask if you could tag along sometime

@rule react.h.friend_text.invite
