- Don't. I'm not ready to cry in public.
- You'd be surprised how much that means, coming from a student.

@rule move.h.teaching_why.share
on move.share
when hook=teaching_why
- Say you never thought of it as a calling

@rule react.h.teaching_why.share
on react
when hook=teaching_why move=share fit=good|neutral
- It's more stubbornness than calling, some days.
- That's all right. It shows up when it shows up.
- Good. Keep your feet on the ground.

@rule react.h.teaching_why.bad
on react
when hook=teaching_why fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't have to take it seriously. I do.
- It isn't a joke to me.

@rule me.h.teaching_tired
on me.small
when hook=teaching_tired
