on move.ask
when hook=teaching_tired
- Ask what the job's really like

@rule react.h.teaching_tired.ask
on react
when hook=teaching_tired move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A lot of chalk, and a lot of hoping.
- You talk all day, then you wonder if anyone heard you.
- Half paperwork, half theater. You'd be surprised.

@rule move.h.teaching_tired.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=teaching_tired
