- That's thoughtful. It's been a long week.
- Don't tell anyone, but I'd love that.

@rule move.h.teaching_tired.tease
on move.tease
when hook=teaching_tired
- Ask if students are worse than the faculty room

@rule react.h.teaching_tired.tease
on react
when hook=teaching_tired move=tease fit=good|neutral
