- What's the faculty room really like?

@rule move.h.teaching_free_gossip.ask
on move.ask
when hook=teaching_free_gossip
- Ask what they say about you

@rule react.h.teaching_free_gossip.ask
on react
when hook=teaching_free_gossip move=ask fit=good|neutral
