- Only that you're always somewhere you shouldn't be.
- That's confidential. Sit down.

@rule move.h.teaching_free_gossip.share
on move.share
when hook=teaching_free_gossip
- Say students suspect as much

@rule react.h.teaching_free_gossip.share
on react
when hook=teaching_free_gossip move=share fit=good|neutral
- Good. Keep suspecting.
- I can neither confirm nor deny.
- Who told you? Was it the math professor?

@rule move.h.teaching_free_gossip.tease
on move.tease
when hook=teaching_free_gossip
