- Whoever eats someone's lunch from the fridge.
- If I told you, I'd have nowhere left to hide.

@rule react.h.teaching_free_gossip.bad
on react
when hook=teaching_free_gossip fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't go repeating any of that.
- That's enough questions.

@rule me.h.teaching_free_candid
