- How do you stay patient with us?

@rule move.h.teaching_free_candid.ask
on move.ask
when hook=teaching_free_candid
- Ask how she keeps a straight face in class

@rule react.h.teaching_free_candid.ask
on react
when hook=teaching_free_candid move=ask fit=good|neutral
