@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_dare.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_dare move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Buy juice. And admit I'm better, out loud.
- I'll think of something worse once you've lost.
- You're scared. I can see it.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_energetic_dare.invite
on move.invite
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_dare
- Accept the challenge

@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_dare.invite
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_dare move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! No backing out! Ready?
- That's the spirit! I won't go easy!
- Ha! You're going to regret that!

@rule move.h.weather_rain_energetic_dare.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_dare
- Say you'd rather watch her fall on her face

@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_dare.tease
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_dare move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You'd never catch me!
- Then watch closely!
- Coward! I'll remember this!

@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_dare.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_dare fit=bad
feel pout
- Boring! You're so boring!
- Fine, I'll go by myself!

@rule me.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored
on me.small
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored
