- Does the rain ruin your plans?

@rule move.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored
- Ask what she'd be doing if it were dry

@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Running! Sweating! Living!
- Practice! I've got all this energy, and nowhere to put it!
- Anything but sitting down!

@rule move.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored
