@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.comfort
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It'd better! I'm counting on you!
- You promise? I'm blaming you if it doesn't!
- Okay! Tomorrow, I'll do twice as much!

@rule move.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored
