@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.tease
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored move=tease fit=good|neutral
- That's frustration! Get used to it!
- Careful, I might explode!
- Ha! Don't stand too close!

@rule react.h.weather_rain_energetic_bored.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_energetic_bored fit=bad
feel pout
- You're not fun at all!
- You don't get it!

@rule me.h.weather_rain_cool_you
on me.small
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you
