- Got caught in it. Look at me.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_you.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you
- Ask if she's got anything to dry off with

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_you.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Handkerchief. Here. You can return it clean.
- There's a towel in my bag. Don't read into it.
- ...Here. Hold still.

