on move.thank
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you
- Thank her for noticing

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_you.thank
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you move=thank fit=good|neutral
- It was the puddle that noticed.
- Don't thank me. Get dry.
- ...You're welcome.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_you.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you
- Ask if she's worried about you

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_you.tease
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'm worried about the floor.
- Don't flatter yourself.
- ...A little. That's enough.

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_you.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_you fit=bad
feel pout
- Do what you like.
- I've said what I had to say.

