on me.small
when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared
- Did you get caught in the rain?
- Did you bring an umbrella?

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_prepared.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared
- Ask if she ever gets caught out

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_prepared.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared move=ask fit=good|neutral
