when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared
- Say she's the only prepared person on campus

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_prepared.praise
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared move=praise fit=good|neutral
- A low bar, but thank you.
- Someone has to be.
- I noticed.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_prepared.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared
