- That's classified.
- You're pushing it.

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_prepared.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_prepared fit=bad
feel pout
- Not my problem.
- You'll learn.

@rule me.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet
