- What do you think of this rain?

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_cool_quiet
- Ask what she does on a day like this

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_quiet move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Read something long. It's a good day for long things.
- You wouldn't know it.
- Whatever keeps people away.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet.agree
on move.agree
when hook=weather_rain_cool_quiet
- Say you like the quiet too

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet.agree
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_quiet move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Then we don't need to talk about it.
- Hm. Good.
- You can stay, if you stay quiet.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet.share
on move.share
when hook=weather_rain_cool_quiet
- Say you're fine just sitting here

@rule react.h.weather_rain_cool_quiet.share
on react
when hook=weather_rain_cool_quiet move=share fit=good|neutral
