- I'll let you hold it. Don't get ideas.
- Hehe. I was hoping you'd say that.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_teasing_umbrella.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_umbrella
- Say you'd rather stay dry alone

@rule react.h.weather_rain_teasing_umbrella.tease
on react
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_umbrella move=tease fit=good|neutral
