- Your loss~
- Good luck with that.

@rule react.h.weather_rain_teasing_umbrella.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_umbrella fit=bad
feel pout
- Then get wet. See if I care~
- Your loss.

@rule me.h.weather_rain_teasing_you
on me.small
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you
- Got caught in it. Look at me.
- Do I look that bad?

@rule move.h.weather_rain_teasing_you.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you
- Ask what's so funny

@rule react.h.weather_rain_teasing_you.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You. All of you. Right now.
- Nothing~ Keep standing there.
- You wouldn't understand. It's the hair.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_teasing_you.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you
