@rule react.h.weather_rain_teasing_you.tease
on react
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Oh, I'm enjoying it exactly the right amount~
- You've got no idea.
- Hehe. Am I that obvious?

@rule move.h.weather_rain_teasing_you.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you
