- You've got nerve. I like that.
- Hmph. Now you're just being sweet.

@rule react.h.weather_rain_teasing_you.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_teasing_you fit=bad
feel pout
- Stop dripping on me.
- You're no fun~

@rule me.h.weather_rain_teasing_blame
