when hook=weather_rain_lover_love
- Do you like the rain?
- You seem happy about the rain.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_lover_love.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_lover_love
- Ask what she loves most about it

@rule react.h.weather_rain_lover_love.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_lover_love move=ask fit=good|neutral
