- The sound on the roof at night.
- Everyone goes quiet, and I don't have to be cheerful.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_lover_love.agree
on move.agree
when hook=weather_rain_lover_love
- Say you know what she means

@rule react.h.weather_rain_lover_love.agree
on react
when hook=weather_rain_lover_love move=agree fit=good|neutral
