- Are you okay with thunder?

@rule move.h.weather_storm_scared.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_storm_scared
- Ask how she feels about storms

@rule react.h.weather_storm_scared.ask
on react
when hook=weather_storm_scared move=ask fit=good|neutral
