- Do you think they'll close the campus?

@rule move.h.weather_storm_home.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_storm_home
- Ask how she's getting home

@rule react.h.weather_storm_home.ask
on react
when hook=weather_storm_home move=ask fit=good|neutral
