- Does it look like rain to you?

@rule move.h.weather_later_umbrella.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_later_umbrella
- Ask if she trusts the forecast

@rule react.h.weather_later_umbrella.ask
on react
when hook=weather_later_umbrella move=ask fit=good|neutral
