- Mostly. That's why I've got this.

@rule move.h.weather_later_umbrella.share
on move.share
when hook=weather_later_umbrella
- Say you left yours at home

@rule react.h.weather_later_umbrella.share
on react
when hook=weather_later_umbrella move=share fit=good|neutral
- Of course you did.
- Well, that's one problem you've got.
- Hm. It's big enough for two.

@rule move.h.weather_later_umbrella.invite
on move.invite
when hook=weather_later_umbrella
- Ask if you can walk with her later

@rule react.h.weather_later_umbrella.invite
on react
when hook=weather_later_umbrella move=invite fit=good|neutral
