- Do you think it'll rain?

@rule move.h.weather_later_race.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_later_race
- Ask what she's got to get home for

@rule react.h.weather_later_race.ask
on react
when hook=weather_later_race move=ask fit=good|neutral
