@rule me.h.weather_clear_window
on me.small
when hook=weather_clear_window
- Beautiful day, isn't it?
- Are you enjoying the sun?

@rule move.h.weather_clear_window.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_clear_window
- Ask what she'll do once class is over

@rule react.h.weather_clear_window.ask
on react
when hook=weather_clear_window move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Stay out until it gets dark.
- Get an ice cream, and not share it.
- Nothing. Slowly. Outside.

@rule move.h.weather_clear_window.share
on move.share
when hook=weather_clear_window
- Say you couldn't stop looking out the window either

@rule react.h.weather_clear_window.share
on react
when hook=weather_clear_window move=share fit=good|neutral
- So that's why you missed the question.
- I saw you. You were worse than me.
- Whoever puts windows in a lecture hall is cruel.

@rule move.h.weather_clear_window.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weather_clear_window
- Say she's getting a tan line from sitting there

@rule react.h.weather_clear_window.tease
on react
when hook=weather_clear_window move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'll call it "academic bronze".
- Hm! It's a good color on me.
- Not everyone can pull it off.

@rule react.h.weather_clear_window.bad
on react
when hook=weather_clear_window fit=bad
feel pout
- You've got no eye for this.
- Then look at something else.

@rule me.h.lunch_invite
on me.small
when hook=lunch_invite
- Have you eaten yet?
- Hungry?

@rule move.h.lunch_invite.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_invite
- Ask what's so good about it

@rule react.h.lunch_invite.ask
on react
when hook=lunch_invite move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It's curry. It doesn't need a reason.
- It's better than what you've got.
- You'll see. Take a bite.

@rule move.h.lunch_invite.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lunch_invite
- Say you'll join her

@rule react.h.lunch_invite.invite
on react
when hook=lunch_invite move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Good! Come on, before it gets cold.
- Okay! Grab a seat.
- I knew you would.

@rule move.h.lunch_invite.thank
on move.thank
when hook=lunch_invite
- Accept with thanks

@rule react.h.lunch_invite.thank
on react
when hook=lunch_invite move=thank fit=good|neutral
- Careful, it's hot. Well?
- Don't look at it. Eat it.
- Hehe. You owe me one.

@rule react.h.lunch_invite.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_invite fit=bad
feel pout
- Then I'll have yours.
- More for me, then.

@rule me.h.lunch_alone
on me.small
when hook=lunch_alone
- What do you usually do for lunch?
- What's for lunch?

@rule move.h.lunch_alone.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_alone
- Ask who she normally eats with

@rule react.h.lunch_alone.ask
on react
when hook=lunch_alone move=ask fit=good|neutral
- {Bff}, when she isn't busy.
- Whoever's around. Today, nobody.
- It's a rotation. There's an opening.

@rule move.h.lunch_alone.share
on move.share
when hook=lunch_alone
- Tell her what you brought

@rule react.h.lunch_alone.share
on react
when hook=lunch_alone move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's not a lunch, that's a cry for help.
- Hm. You could've told me that was all you had.
- Honestly? I'd trade.

@rule move.h.lunch_alone.invite
on move.invite
when hook=lunch_alone
- Offer to eat with her today

@rule react.h.lunch_alone.invite
on react
when hook=lunch_alone move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Today? Okay. I'd like that.
- You've got a nerve. Yes.
- Then I'll save you a seat.

@rule react.h.lunch_alone.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_alone fit=bad
feel pout
- Never mind.
- Eat wherever you want.

@rule me.h.lunch_hungry
on me.small
when hook=lunch_hungry
- Have you eaten yet?
- You look hungry.

@rule move.h.lunch_hungry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_hungry
- Ask what she's actually craving

@rule react.h.lunch_hungry.ask
on react
when hook=lunch_hungry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something hot, with far too much sauce.
- {Fav} would be nice, but I'll eat anything.
- A real meal. One I didn't make.

@rule move.h.lunch_hungry.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=lunch_hungry
- Offer her something from your bag

@rule react.h.lunch_hungry.comfort
on react
when hook=lunch_hungry move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Really? You're saving my life.
- Don't be nice to me when I'm this hungry.
- I'm taking it before you change your mind.

@rule move.h.lunch_hungry.tease
on move.tease
when hook=lunch_hungry
- Say you can hear her stomach from here

@rule react.h.lunch_hungry.tease
on react
when hook=lunch_hungry move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You did not! Did you?
- That's a private conversation.
- It's saying your name. Be afraid.

@rule react.h.lunch_hungry.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_hungry fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't talk to me about food right now.
- You're not funny when I'm hungry.

@rule me.h.lunch_plan
on me.small
when hook=lunch_plan
- What's for lunch?
- What do you usually do for lunch?

@rule move.h.lunch_plan.ask
on move.ask
when hook=lunch_plan
- Ask what she'd pick if money were no object

@rule react.h.lunch_plan.ask
on react
when hook=lunch_plan move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A real steak. On a Tuesday. In class.
- Everything. One of each.
- Whatever's in the window at that place on the corner.

@rule move.h.lunch_plan.share
on move.share
when hook=lunch_plan
- Say the line isn't worth it

@rule react.h.lunch_plan.share
on react
when hook=lunch_plan move=share fit=good|neutral
- Finally, someone sane.
- You say that, but I've seen you in it.
- That's what the good bread's for.

@rule move.h.lunch_plan.tease
on move.tease
when hook=lunch_plan
- Say you'd bet she made a plan for it in first period

@rule react.h.lunch_plan.tease
on react
when hook=lunch_plan move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Second. I'm not obsessed.
- Lunch is the only real subject.
- You'd have done the same.

@rule react.h.lunch_plan.bad
on react
when hook=lunch_plan fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't judge my lunch.
- It's only lunch.

@rule me.h.weekend_open
on me.small
when hook=weekend_open
- Any plans for the weekend?
- Doing anything fun this weekend?

@rule move.h.weekend_open.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weekend_open
- Ask what she'd really want to do

@rule react.h.weekend_open.ask
on react
when hook=weekend_open move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something that isn't planned by anyone else.
- Go out and not come back until I'm tired.
- Good question. Nobody ever asks.

@rule move.h.weekend_open.invite
on move.invite
when hook=weekend_open
- Ask if she wants to go together

@rule react.h.weekend_open.invite
on react
when hook=weekend_open move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Hm! I thought you'd never ask.
- Are you asking me out? Okay.
- Maybe. Tell me where first.

@rule move.h.weekend_open.share
on move.share
when hook=weekend_open
- Say you've got nothing planned either

@rule react.h.weekend_open.share
on react
when hook=weekend_open move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then we're both tragic.
- Hm. That's interesting to know.
- So it's a free weekend. Good.

@rule react.h.weekend_open.bad
on react
when hook=weekend_open fit=bad
feel pout
- I'll probably just stay home.
- Don't make it weird.

@rule me.h.weekend_stuck
on me.small
when hook=weekend_stuck
- Any plans for the weekend?
- Are you free this weekend?

@rule move.h.weekend_stuck.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weekend_stuck
- Ask if there's any way out of it

@rule react.h.weekend_stuck.ask
on react
when hook=weekend_stuck move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A good excuse. Got one?
- Not unless I catch something.
- I've been working on that all week.

@rule move.h.weekend_stuck.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=weekend_stuck
- Say you'll think of her while she suffers

@rule react.h.weekend_stuck.comfort
on react
when hook=weekend_stuck move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- How touching.
- That'll get me through. Barely.
- You're very kind. Send snacks.

@rule move.h.weekend_stuck.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weekend_stuck
- Suggest she fake an illness

@rule react.h.weekend_stuck.tease
on react
when hook=weekend_stuck move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I've used that one. They've got a chart.
- You're a bad influence. Keep talking.
- That's going in my notes.

@rule react.h.weekend_stuck.bad
on react
when hook=weekend_stuck fit=bad
feel pout
- Thanks for nothing.
- It's not funny.

@rule me.h.weekend_rest
on me.small
when hook=weekend_rest
- How was your weekend?
- What do you do on weekends?

@rule move.h.weekend_rest.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weekend_rest
- Ask what her perfect Sunday looks like

@rule react.h.weekend_rest.ask
on react
when hook=weekend_rest move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Wake up when I want. Eat something bad. Repeat.
- Nobody needs me, and the sun's out.
- Same as Saturday.

@rule move.h.weekend_rest.share
on move.share
when hook=weekend_rest
- Say you slept through last Sunday too

@rule react.h.weekend_rest.share
on react
when hook=weekend_rest move=share fit=good|neutral
- A person of culture.
- Finally. Everyone else lies about it.
- We're the same, you and I.

@rule move.h.weekend_rest.tease
on move.tease
when hook=weekend_rest
- Say she could sleep through a fire alarm

@rule react.h.weekend_rest.tease
on react
when hook=weekend_rest move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I have. Twice.
- Only if it's a weekend.
- Try and wake me. See what happens.

@rule react.h.weekend_rest.bad
on react
when hook=weekend_rest fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't judge my weekend.
- What's wrong with resting?

@rule me.h.place_secret
on me.small
when hook=place_secret
- Do you come here often?
- What brings you here?
- Why this spot?

@rule move.h.place_secret.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_secret
- Ask how she found this spot

@rule react.h.place_secret.ask
on react
when hook=place_secret move=ask fit=good|neutral
- By accident, the day I needed one.
- I followed a cat. I'm not joking.
- I was hiding from something. It worked.

@rule move.h.place_secret.share
on move.share
when hook=place_secret
- Promise not to tell anyone

@rule react.h.place_secret.share
on react
when hook=place_secret move=share fit=good|neutral
- Good. I'd have to stop coming.
- I'm trusting you with this, you know.
- Thanks. Now it's a secret for two.

@rule move.h.place_secret.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_secret
- Ask if you could join her here sometime

@rule react.h.place_secret.invite
on react
when hook=place_secret move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Only if you don't bring anyone.
- Hm. I could get used to that.
- It's a good spot for two. If they're quiet.

@rule react.h.place_secret.bad
on react
when hook=place_secret fit=bad
feel pout
- You'd better leave it alone, then.
- Forget I said anything.

@rule me.h.place_crowded
on me.small
when hook=place_crowded
- What do you think of {thing}?
- Do you come here often?

@rule move.h.place_crowded.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_crowded
- Ask where she'd go instead

@rule react.h.place_crowded.ask
on react
when hook=place_crowded move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The roof, if it's open.
- Anywhere with fewer people talking.
- There's a place I like better. You'd have to earn it.

@rule move.h.place_crowded.share
on move.share
when hook=place_crowded
- Say you keep ending up here too

@rule react.h.place_crowded.share
on react
when hook=place_crowded move=share fit=good|neutral
- I've seen you. You look lost.
- It's that kind of place.
- Then we'll keep running into each other.

@rule move.h.place_crowded.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_crowded
- Ask if {thing} charges her rent yet

@rule react.h.place_crowded.tease
on react
when hook=place_crowded move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I've got a loyalty card.
- At this point, it owes me.
- Don't tell the management.

@rule react.h.place_crowded.bad
on react
when hook=place_crowded fit=bad
feel pout
- Find your own spot.
- You don't have to stay.

@rule me.h.place_story
on me.small
when hook=place_story
- What brings you here?
- Anything happen here today?

@rule move.h.place_story.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_story
- Ask what happened here

@rule react.h.place_story.ask
on react
when hook=place_story move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You don't want to know... You really do, don't you?
- I was told not to talk about it.
- Nothing that can be proven.

@rule move.h.place_story.share
on move.share
when hook=place_story
- Say {thing} feels different today

@rule react.h.place_story.share
on react
when hook=place_story move=share fit=good|neutral
- You feel that too?
- It's better now, I'd say.
- Maybe it's the company.

@rule move.h.place_story.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_story
- Ask if she's got a plaque here yet

@rule react.h.place_story.tease
on react
when hook=place_story move=tease fit=good|neutral
- "She fell asleep here." Yes, it's coming.
- I'm waiting for the statue.
- It's on order.

@rule react.h.place_story.bad
on react
when hook=place_story fit=bad
feel pout
- It's only a place.
- Never mind.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_rain_read
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read
- What are you reading?
- Good day for a book, huh?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_read.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read
- Ask what makes it a rainy-day book

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_read.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It's slow, and somebody in it is always looking out a window.
- You can't read it in the sun. It doesn't work.
- It's the kind of book that wants you to stay.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_read.share
on move.share
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read
- Say you'll borrow whatever she recommends

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_read.share
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read move=share fit=good|neutral
- Careful. I'll quiz you.
- Then I've got the perfect one.
- Bring it back unbroken.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_read.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read
- Ask if the book has a blanket too

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_read.tease
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't mock the blanket.
- It's a package deal.
- Yes, and I'm not sharing it.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_read.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_read fit=bad
feel pout
- You wouldn't finish it anyway.
- Shh. Let me read.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy
- Good day for a book, huh?
- Do you like reading when it rains?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy
- Ask how long she's been here

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Since the first drops. I've lost track.
- Long enough to have a favorite drop.
- What time is it? Oh.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.share
on move.share
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy
- Say you could stay until it stops

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.share
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then sit. Quietly.
- There's a spare chair. I wasn't saving it.
- That's the right idea.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy
- Say you're dripping on her favorite book

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.tease
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Stop! Back away, slowly!
- Move it, and nobody gets hurt.
- That's the last warning.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_cozy.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_cozy fit=bad
feel pout
- You're letting the rain in.
- Shh.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_shelf
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_shelf
- What are you reading?
- Can you recommend a book?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_shelf.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_shelf
- Ask for the one book she'd save from a fire

@rule react.h.place_library_books_shelf.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_shelf move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Don't make me do this. It's the one by my pillow.
- The one with no cover. I've read it into pieces.
- I'd stay and fight the fire.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_shelf.share
on move.share
when hook=place_library_books_shelf
- Tell her the last thing you read

@rule react.h.place_library_books_shelf.share
on react
when hook=place_library_books_shelf move=share fit=good|neutral
- That counts as reading? All right.
- Hm. There's hope for you.
- I'm not going to say anything.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_shelf.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_library_books_shelf
- Ask her to pick something for you

@rule react.h.place_library_books_shelf.invite
on react
when hook=place_library_books_shelf move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Oh, you'll regret that. Here, start with this.
- Are you serious? Give me a minute. Don't move.
- Okay, but you'll have to tell me what you think.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_shelf.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_shelf fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't have to pretend.
- Read whatever you like.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_reader
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_reader
- You're always here, huh?
- What's so great about the library?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_reader.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_reader
- Ask what she's in the middle of

@rule react.h.place_library_books_reader.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_reader move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It's about someone who can't go home. I can't stop.
- I'm at the good part. Ask me again in an hour.
- It's long, and everyone's lying. I love it.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_reader.praise
on move.praise
when hook=place_library_books_reader
- Say you've never seen anyone read like her

@rule react.h.place_library_books_reader.praise
on react
when hook=place_library_books_reader move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It's nothing. I've just got nothing better to do.
- You're distracting me... Thanks.
- You should see me on a good day.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_reader.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_books_reader
- Say the librarian's going to adopt her

@rule react.h.place_library_books_reader.tease
on react
when hook=place_library_books_reader move=tease fit=good|neutral
- She's already offered.
- It's only a matter of time.
- I've got my own stamp.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_reader.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_reader fit=bad
feel pout
- One more chapter. Go away.
- I was at the good part.

@rule me.h.place_library_nobooks_hide
on me.small
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide
- You don't look like you're reading.
- What brings you to the library?

@rule move.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide
- Ask who she's hiding from

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everyone. Mainly my assignments.
- Someone with a very long reading list.
- If I tell you, you'll have to hide too.

@rule move.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.share
on move.share
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide
- Say you're here for the chairs too

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.share
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide move=share fit=good|neutral
- Finally! Someone honest.
- There's a good corner. I'll show you.
- The back row's better. Trust me.

@rule move.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide
- Say the book's upside down

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.tease
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...It's a modern style.
- You saw nothing.
- Who are you, the librarian?

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_hide.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_hide fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't tell on me.
- I'm reading. Look.

@rule me.h.place_library_nobooks_bored
on me.small
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored
- You don't look happy to be here.
- Not much of a reader?

@rule move.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored
- Ask what she'd rather be doing

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Literally anything with noise in it.
- Being outside. Being anywhere.
- Is it lunch? It feels like it should be lunch.

@rule move.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored
- Offer to walk out with her

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.comfort
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Please. Right now.
- You're my hero.
- I thought you'd never say it.

@rule move.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored
- Say you've seen her on page one for an hour

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.tease
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It's a hard page.
- I'm taking it slowly.
- You've been watching me for an hour?

@rule react.h.place_library_nobooks_bored.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_nobooks_bored fit=bad
feel pout
- Shh. You're the one who's noisy.
- Not you too.

@rule me.h.place_classroom_lunch_invite
on me.small
when hook=place_classroom_lunch_invite
- Eating here today?
- Is this seat taken?

@rule move.h.place_classroom_lunch_invite.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_classroom_lunch_invite
- Ask what's left

@rule react.h.place_classroom_lunch_invite.ask
on react
when hook=place_classroom_lunch_invite move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Half an egg, and a lot of goodwill.
- Rice. Mostly rice.
- Whatever you can get to first.

@rule move.h.place_classroom_lunch_invite.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_classroom_lunch_invite
- Take the seat next to her

@rule react.h.place_classroom_lunch_invite.invite
on react
when hook=place_classroom_lunch_invite move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Good. Don't touch my egg.
