@rule move.h.place_library_books_fight_corner.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_library_books_fight_corner
- Say {fightwho} will come around

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_corner.comfort
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_corner move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Hm. We'll see.
- I hope you're right.
- You're kind. I'll keep reading until then.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_fight_corner.share
on move.share
when hook=place_library_books_fight_corner
- Say you'll sit in the corner with her for a while

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_corner.share
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_corner move=share fit=good|neutral
- You don't have to talk.
- ...Thanks. It's a good corner.
- Okay. Bring a book.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_corner.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_corner fit=bad
feel pout
- I came here so people wouldn't ask.
- I'd like to be alone.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain
- Are you okay? You've been on that page for a while.
- What's the book?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain
- Ask what's in the saddest book on the shelf

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Two people who should've talked. Funny, right?
- You don't want to read it.
- It's about a fight that doesn't get fixed.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain
- Say you hope she and {fightwho} make up

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.comfort
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Me too. I can't say it to her, though.
- Thanks. It's nice someone asked.
- I'd like that.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.share
on move.share
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain
- Say the rain will stop eventually

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.share
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain move=share fit=good|neutral
- Are we still talking about the rain?
- Thanks. I know what you mean.
- I hope so.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_rain.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_rain fit=bad
feel pout
- Please, let me read.
- It's nothing to do with you.

@rule me.h.place_rivalnear_rival
on me.small
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival
- What's wrong?
- Who are you looking at?

@rule move.h.place_rivalnear_rival.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival
- Ask what's with her and {rivalnear}

@rule react.h.place_rivalnear_rival.ask
on react
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival move=ask fit=good|neutral
- She knows what she did.
- It's old history. It's also her fault.
- You don't want to get into it.

@rule move.h.place_rivalnear_rival.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival
- Offer to wave {rivalnear} over

@rule react.h.place_rivalnear_rival.tease
on react
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't you dare!
- I'll never speak to you again!
- Touch that hand, and it's gone.

@rule move.h.place_rivalnear_rival.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival
- Say {rivalnear} isn't worth it

@rule react.h.place_rivalnear_rival.comfort
on react
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Thank you! Finally, someone's said it.
- You're right. Let's go.
- That's what I keep telling myself.

@rule react.h.place_rivalnear_rival.bad
on react
when hook=place_rivalnear_rival fit=bad
feel pout
- You're on her side, aren't you?
- Don't get involved.

@rule me.h.pet_food_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_food_ask
- Hungry again?
- Got room for more?
- You always know where the good food is, huh?

@rule move.h.pet_food_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_food_ask
- Tell her the best thing you ate this week

@rule react.h.pet_food_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_food_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- Stop, I'm drooling. Where was it?
- That's going on my list. Right at the top.
- And you didn't bring me any? Unbelievable.

@rule move.h.pet_food_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_food_ask
- Ask what she'd eat right now

@rule react.h.pet_food_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_food_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A katsu sandwich. Two. Don't judge me.
- Anything warm with a lot of sauce.
- Honestly? Whatever's closest.

@rule move.h.pet_food_ask.invite
on move.invite
when hook=pet_food_ask
- Offer to buy her a snack later

@rule react.h.pet_food_ask.invite
on react
when hook=pet_food_ask move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You say that, but I'll hold you to it.
- Deal. I'm choosing, though.
- You're dangerous. Yes.

@rule react.h.pet_food_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_food_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- Food is serious business.
- Laugh, but I'll be the one eating.

@rule me.h.pet_food_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_food_talk
- Thinking about food again?
- What's on the menu in that head of yours?

@rule move.h.pet_food_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_food_talk
- Ask how she eats so much

@rule react.h.pet_food_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_food_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Big lunch, small worries. That's the secret.
- I walk fast. It all burns off. Probably.
- I don't think about it. I just eat.

@rule move.h.pet_food_talk.praise
on move.praise
when hook=pet_food_talk
- Say it's nice to see someone enjoy food that much

@rule react.h.pet_food_talk.praise
on react
when hook=pet_food_talk move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Right? Eating should be fun!
- You're the first person who didn't call me a bottomless pit.
- Thanks. Most people just stare at my tray.

@rule move.h.pet_food_talk.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_food_talk
- Ask if she's ever skipped a meal

@rule react.h.pet_food_talk.tease
on react
when hook=pet_food_talk move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Once. I still think about it.
- Never. I'm not a monster.
- Breakfast, maybe. Then I ate two lunches.

@rule react.h.pet_food_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_food_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't count my rice bowls.
- Hmph. I'm hungry, not rude.

@rule me.h.pet_books_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_books_ask
- Read anything good lately?
- You always have a book on you, huh?
- Got a recommendation for me?

@rule move.h.pet_books_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_books_ask
- Tell her the last book you actually finished

@rule react.h.pet_books_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_books_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh, I know that one! What did you think of the ending?
- Huh. Not what I expected from you. In a good way.
- Then you have to read the sequel. I insist.

@rule move.h.pet_books_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_books_ask
- Ask what she'd recommend for you

@rule react.h.pet_books_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_books_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something short and sharp. I'll pick one out.
- Give me a day. I'll make you a list.
- Mysteries. You look like someone who'd guess the ending.

@rule move.h.pet_books_ask.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_books_ask
- Ask if she judges people by their bookshelves

@rule react.h.pet_books_ask.tease
on react
when hook=pet_books_ask move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only a little. Okay, a lot.
- Yes. And yours worries me.
- Doesn't everyone?

@rule react.h.pet_books_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_books_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- Books aren't a joke to me.
- Never mind. You wouldn't get it.

@rule me.h.pet_books_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_books_talk
- What are you reading?
- Still on that same book?

@rule move.h.pet_books_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_books_talk
- Ask what she likes about reading

@rule react.h.pet_books_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_books_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You get to live somewhere else for a while.
- It's quiet, and nobody interrupts.
- Other people's lives are more interesting than mine.

@rule move.h.pet_books_talk.praise
on move.praise
when hook=pet_books_talk
- Say you admire how much she reads

@rule react.h.pet_books_talk.praise
on react
when hook=pet_books_talk move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It's not hard. You just never stop.
- You'd read more if you had my commute.
- Thanks. Most people say it's antisocial.

@rule move.h.pet_books_talk.invite
on move.invite
when hook=pet_books_talk
- Suggest a trip to the used bookshop together

@rule react.h.pet_books_talk.invite
on react
when hook=pet_books_talk move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? I could spend hours there. You've been warned.
- Okay, but you carry the bags.
- I'd like that. I know exactly which aisle.

@rule react.h.pet_books_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_books_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- Fine. Go play your games.
- That's a rude thing to say to a reader.

@rule me.h.pet_music_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_music_ask
- What are you listening to these days?
- Got a song stuck in your head?
- You're humming again.

@rule move.h.pet_music_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_music_ask
- Tell her the song you've had on repeat

@rule react.h.pet_music_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_music_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh, that's a good one! The bridge is the best part.
- Really? I didn't take you for that kind. I like it.
- I'll listen to it tonight. If it's bad, I'm telling you.

@rule move.h.pet_music_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_music_ask
- Ask what her favorite band is

@rule react.h.pet_music_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_music_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- That's like picking a favorite child. Three, okay?
- You won't know them. They're tiny. That's the point.
- It changes every week. This week it's sad songs.

@rule move.h.pet_music_ask.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_music_ask
- Ask if she sings karaoke

@rule react.h.pet_music_ask.tease
on react
when hook=pet_music_ask move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only after midnight, and only power ballads.
- Never sober.
- Maybe. Why, are you asking me out?

@rule react.h.pet_music_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_music_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- You're not taking this seriously.
- Forget it. My music, my business.

@rule me.h.pet_music_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_music_talk
- Is that a new song you're humming?
- What's in your earphones today?

@rule move.h.pet_music_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_music_talk
- Ask what's been on her playlist

@rule react.h.pet_music_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_music_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Old city pop, mostly. It feels like summer.
- Sad songs, but happy sad songs.
- The same five songs. I'm a creature of habit.

@rule move.h.pet_music_talk.praise
on move.praise
when hook=pet_music_talk
- Say she must have a good ear

@rule react.h.pet_music_talk.praise
on react
when hook=pet_music_talk move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You think so? I just hear things others miss.
- Mm. It's a curse sometimes. Bad speakers hurt.
- Thanks. Nobody's ever said that.

@rule move.h.pet_music_talk.invite
on move.invite
when hook=pet_music_talk
- Ask if she'd go to a live show with you

@rule react.h.pet_music_talk.invite
on react
when hook=pet_music_talk move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! If you can get tickets, I'm in.
- Really? Okay. I'm wearing earplugs, though.
- Only if you don't talk during the songs.

@rule react.h.pet_music_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_music_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- You're one of those "I listen to everything" people, aren't you.
- Never mind.

@rule me.h.pet_sports_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_sports_ask
- You play sports, right?
- Always on the move, huh?
- Got a game coming up?

@rule move.h.pet_sports_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_sports_ask
- Tell her which sport you used to play

@rule react.h.pet_sports_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_sports_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? We should play sometime. I'll be nice. Maybe.
- I can see it. You've got the stance.
- Then you know the feeling after a good game.

@rule move.h.pet_sports_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_sports_ask
- Ask what she's training for

@rule react.h.pet_sports_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_sports_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The regional match. We lost it twice in a row. Not again.
- Beating last year's me. She was slow.
- Nothing. I just like being tired.

@rule move.h.pet_sports_ask.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_sports_ask
- Ask if she'd really go easy on you

@rule react.h.pet_sports_ask.tease
on react
when hook=pet_sports_ask move=tease fit=good|neutral
- No. Never.
- I'd try. My body wouldn't let me.
- Maybe for the first minute.

@rule react.h.pet_sports_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_sports_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't laugh at sports.
- Fine. Sit on the bench, then.

@rule me.h.pet_sports_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_sports_talk
- Been training again?
- You look like you just came from practice.

@rule move.h.pet_sports_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_sports_talk
- Ask what she loves about playing

@rule react.h.pet_sports_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_sports_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The moment right before you score. Everything goes quiet.
- Being so tired you can't think.
- The team. Winning's nice too.

@rule move.h.pet_sports_talk.praise
on move.praise
when hook=pet_sports_talk
- Say she must work really hard at it

@rule react.h.pet_sports_talk.praise
on react
when hook=pet_sports_talk move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Every morning. Every single one.
- It doesn't feel like work. That's the trick.
- Thanks. My coach would disagree.

@rule move.h.pet_sports_talk.invite
on move.invite
when hook=pet_sports_talk
- Ask if you can join her for practice

@rule react.h.pet_sports_talk.invite
on react
when hook=pet_sports_talk move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure, if you can keep up. Warm-ups are brutal.
- Come Saturday. Bring water. Lots.
- You'd quit in ten minutes. Come anyway.

@rule react.h.pet_sports_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_sports_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- You sound like the people who think sports are dumb.
- Whatever. I'm going for a run.

@rule me.h.pet_cleaning_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask
- You like things tidy, huh?
- Everything in its place?
- You noticed the mess too?

@rule move.h.pet_cleaning_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask
- Admit your room is a disaster right now

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- I knew it. I could tell from your bag.
- Give me one hour in there. I'll change your life.
- Honestly? Thank you for not lying.

@rule move.h.pet_cleaning_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask
- Ask what bothers her most

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Trays left on tables. Every single time.
- Crooked posters. I fix them when nobody's looking.
- Sticky things. Don't make me list them.

@rule move.h.pet_cleaning_ask.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask
- Ask if she'd clean your room for you

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_ask.tease
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask move=tease fit=good|neutral
- For a price. A high price.
- Don't tempt me. I'd actually do it.
- I'd need a hazmat suit, wouldn't I?

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- Laugh, but you'd love a clean room.
- It's not weird to like things clean.

@rule me.h.pet_cleaning_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk
- Tidying up again?
- You keep everything so neat.

@rule move.h.pet_cleaning_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk
- Ask why it makes her feel better

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- When the room is in order, my head is too.
- It's the one thing I can always fix.
- I don't know. It just feels like breathing out.

@rule move.h.pet_cleaning_talk.praise
on move.praise
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk
- Say she must be the most organized person on campus

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_talk.praise
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Probably. I don't like to brag. I'm bragging.
- Second, maybe. There's a girl in accounting...
- Thank you. Finally, someone sees it.

@rule move.h.pet_cleaning_talk.agree
on move.agree
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk
- Say a clean desk does help you focus

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_talk.agree
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Right? It's science. Probably.
- See? You understand.
- Then let me fix yours.

@rule react.h.pet_cleaning_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_cleaning_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not obsessive. It's tidy.
- You can keep your mess.

@rule me.h.pet_naps_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_naps_ask
- Tired again?
- Did you sleep at all last night?
- Looking for a place to lie down?

@rule move.h.pet_naps_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_naps_ask
- Admit you nap in the library too

@rule react.h.pet_naps_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_naps_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- I knew it! We're the same kind of person.
- Which corner? I have to know.
- We should form a club. Meetings are naps.

@rule move.h.pet_naps_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_naps_ask
- Ask where her secret napping spot is

@rule react.h.pet_naps_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_naps_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The bench behind the gym. In the shade. Don't tell anyone.
- If I told you, it wouldn't be secret.
- Somewhere warm and quiet. That's all you get.

@rule move.h.pet_naps_ask.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_naps_ask
- Ask if she's awake right now

@rule react.h.pet_naps_ask.tease
on react
when hook=pet_naps_ask move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Barely. Talk slower.
- I'm awake on the inside.
- ...Mm? Sorry, what?

@rule react.h.pet_naps_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_naps_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't call me lazy.
- Let me sleep in peace.

@rule me.h.pet_naps_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_naps_talk
- You look half asleep.
- Rough night?

@rule move.h.pet_naps_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_naps_talk
- Ask how she stays awake in class

@rule react.h.pet_naps_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_naps_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I don't. That's the trick.
- Coffee and spite.
- I sit near the window. Then I give up.

@rule move.h.pet_naps_talk.agree
on move.agree
when hook=pet_naps_talk
- Say a short nap beats any energy drink

@rule react.h.pet_naps_talk.agree
on react
when hook=pet_naps_talk move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Yes! Finally someone gets it.
- I'll quote you on that.
- Exactly. Now let's go take one.

@rule move.h.pet_naps_talk.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_naps_talk
- Say she'd sleep through an earthquake

@rule react.h.pet_naps_talk.tease
on react
when hook=pet_naps_talk move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I did. Twice.
- Only the small ones.
- I'd wake up for lunch, though.

@rule react.h.pet_naps_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_naps_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- You sound like my mother.
- Fine. I'm going to sleep anyway.

@rule me.h.pet_studying_ask
on me.small
when hook=pet_studying_ask
- Studying again?
- Ahead of the class as usual?
- You really like this stuff, huh?

@rule move.h.pet_studying_ask.share
on move.share
when hook=pet_studying_ask
- Admit you haven't even started yet

@rule react.h.pet_studying_ask.share
on react
when hook=pet_studying_ask move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then start tonight. I'll check tomorrow.
- You're going to regret that. I'll help, a little.
- ...I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that.

@rule move.h.pet_studying_ask.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_studying_ask
- Ask how she keeps it all straight

@rule react.h.pet_studying_ask.ask
on react
when hook=pet_studying_ask move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Lists. Lists of lists, really.
- A little every day. Never a lot at once.
- I explain it to my plant. If the plant gets it, I get it.

@rule move.h.pet_studying_ask.invite
on move.invite
when hook=pet_studying_ask
- Ask if she'd study with you

@rule react.h.pet_studying_ask.invite
on react
when hook=pet_studying_ask move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Only if you actually study. No chatting.
- Yes. The library, second floor, by the window.
- Okay. I'll bring the spare highlighters.

@rule react.h.pet_studying_ask.bad
on react
when hook=pet_studying_ask fit=bad
feel pout
- Studying isn't boring, you're just bad at it.
- Fine. Fail, then.

@rule me.h.pet_studying_talk
on me.small
when hook=pet_studying_talk
- Still at it?
- How much did you get through today?

@rule move.h.pet_studying_talk.ask
on move.ask
when hook=pet_studying_talk
- Ask what she's studying so hard for

@rule react.h.pet_studying_talk.ask
on react
when hook=pet_studying_talk move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I want to choose where I go after this, not be chosen.
- A scholarship. And pride, a little.
- Because I like it. Is that strange?

@rule move.h.pet_studying_talk.praise
on move.praise
when hook=pet_studying_talk
- Say her notes look better than the textbook

@rule react.h.pet_studying_talk.praise
on react
when hook=pet_studying_talk move=praise fit=good|neutral
- They are better. The textbook has mistakes.
- Thank you. It took all weekend.
- You can borrow them. Carefully.

@rule move.h.pet_studying_talk.tease
on move.tease
when hook=pet_studying_talk
- Ask if she ever takes a break

@rule react.h.pet_studying_talk.tease
on react
when hook=pet_studying_talk move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I take a break to study something else.
- Of course. I review on the train.
- ...Define "break."

@rule react.h.pet_studying_talk.bad
on react
when hook=pet_studying_talk fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't make fun of people who work hard.
- I'll remember that at exam time.
